 increases the more remote (logically, and physically) an attacker can be in order to exploit the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_c13207807677b3fe" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_6222cbe778251f55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9f8f8d6b0ad029f5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_226e3a9c38f25cc9" source="e_f18bdb19e94ba6dc" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exist in to exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_60928ab75bc87cff</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_29d666a66bebec11" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_01558e47b2eef8dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f2bb43838467e32e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_00802ae33df31811" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_7c2ea70eaaaaf7b7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cdf0702ae85fd1b3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_add13e035f8da4f8" source="e_213a633d7417fc58" target="e_70d08b8077a5c72d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is required</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f901a8e679416979</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If a specific configuration is required for an attack to succeed, the Base metrics should be scored assuming the vulnerable component is in that configuration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3fabe1ad5a39ec27" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expect repeatable success against</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6949058da6fc0af4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker can expect repeatable success against the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d99dda52f1ddf54e" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_6f4e9633d33400d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expect</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9e6b15ad917323ab</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker can expect repeatable success against the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_9e3f1cfee014e8f2" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes level of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d0cf11a8854f4ed4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_cac76f50a2f738b1" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess before exploiting vulnerability</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_470c30146127dd5e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1e5e5567ec569384" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1b1290795695e55b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c56cce1f32719a8a" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_9bf6ead54114b2ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unauthorized prior to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8a25ccf7c449b8a5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker is unauthorized prior to attack, and therefore does not require any access to settings or files to carry out an attack</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_aa942142d8704c93" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_4ff55a19c43dfad3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">captures</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_645f7a5aee7ec2f9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_cb5cfe8151c8b610" source="e_1c8a4e08eb9cf221" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be participate in successful compromise</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_058b95cbc486f724</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_32ff76f502241c05" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited at will of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d4c97fd9e106bde3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_7c244de9ca1cbdb0" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_060bbd297383d5a7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dcd099b79bdc790d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_7fb2957619da80b7" source="e_544178d28761a5ab" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ff5e268e2b691918</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7003942034b1bcbc" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bd8ba31e01d77f99</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url"