data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a825db3eaf0edbb7" source="e_3332b20efeafa93a" target="e_3fba628e91443cb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_702cbfef3fd5bbb6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a945c5f56e8b4fb9" source="e_87a35caaa98faf5a" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affect resources managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f8385693d1478f4d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_057830cb2e36f750" source="e_c4631f903e1159e5" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f81d3c8494e829f1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b14badf400001ec5" source="e_0651ca14b1e582f2" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_211a8b64a8ea1d98</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_66f18569d154491f" source="e_26e0466f06957bd3" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6d3c2dd76299347e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_643cdc1501f832f5" source="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d95c557bfa3bd512</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_93e3d728b6260345" source="e_841d5cae83210039" target="e_c1b8569aebaf6353"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f4e35183bbeebc24</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the confidentiality of the information resources managed by a software component due to a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e2974d3ef80270fb" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_6e5ec707cbc044ff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_87426b3fca757d79</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0c3d3c8870f165f6" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_8b2074bad160dde7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3a6fb6932bb9b0d7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c9aafd184c5e53e9" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_a15d5fd58349b1ad"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to preventing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7810bc2c80a7a423</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ef21dde8c89d1731" source="e_fabb36a448bb30b7" target="e_eb1797b298a230c0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disclosed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f4681b77310d5a73</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, access to only some restricted information is obtained, but the disclosed information presents a direct, serious impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6dd9baa74482d8a1" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to trustworthiness of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a4ce460e7419faea</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_056ce99b2a8eb9f3" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_edea54677a8d7d64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d59dbc560ac35bf5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_660b0bf8b3e97226" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_26e0466f06957bd3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3fbe1d435b4350c1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_93754f8fc27b735e" source="e_332fd4a216e1c401" target="e_2228b2b192c550b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4944ac91949c0697</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the availability of the impacted component resulting from a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4e30d4cbd376e68e" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_b6ca085d15d6ffbc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_78a0a64030880142</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It refers to the loss of availability of the impacted component itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_48b2af474c3b01ea" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_841d5cae83210039"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ef94ad81a19dbc7c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4053b6bcea62daf7" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_bf0bee0969a73481"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0322c29a9a0f46d2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5e25b82ff9f96e84" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_d37e8eb9896152d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4c3b403fc73e0d05</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f8cd6ea2d9802186" source="e_22e800482ee5b5fd" target="e_4058f076b2d4719d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consume</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dd278ed009449947</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_36b3718478872370" source="e_2e8abed75545c7af" target="e_192d269409538681"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">presents</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_db6207b29eda8159</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_941af299808d7536" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_c00ecbf5fe9852a6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disrupt existing connections</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_88ee08df89ebeb2a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_ac9f9936aa27fd59" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_2f4023a0baf3a38d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disrupt</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e97ff9e40334fcc8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f548f231abf2d98b" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_c7fbbe2b7d7f160a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">prevent</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_761ace1777e9a7a8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_c18ec39b750876f9" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_b082256680928c6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">causes service to become</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6cafcce6a8c148f0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_66ff6704a6d02ea2" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_9111a79bb0a0398b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">causes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_356507898712bed5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_675b4061a1021b37" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_b082256680928c6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be become</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b3b4596bd9615c02</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_53f3ed417f7c0a2b" source="e_dd256f5f1485834f" target="e_7adbd4ff7f080bab"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_85d0d5f41f11bbf3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the likelihood of the vulnerability being attacked, and is typically based on the current state of exploit techniques, public availability of exploit code, or active, 'in-the-wild' exploitation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ceadb59a64de1adb" source="e_527c56c7674a26dd" target="e_904da0b4f3960fb3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is important factor for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2baa48363ac62fab</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Remediation Level of a vulnerability is an important factor for prioritization</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_19da5781436f636a" source="e_4228490cbf8a6d91" target="e_98c110f1e21aa4eb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unpatched when</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_76ba38aa28f5ab21</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The typical vulnerability is unpatched when initially published</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0f4d3dff871df466" source="e_791715a2772f6f50" target="e_ccb9c0114a2220f3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">patch</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c6ad86f0e93b9d06</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Workarounds or hotfixes may offer interim remediation until an official patch or upgrade is issued</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_da401d512c9c179a" source="e_edf56b768b8904e2" target="e_a568574ebde0ab4b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">becomes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_15373b5a45a779d5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Each of these respective stages adjusts the temporal score downwards, reflecting the decreasing urgency as remediation becomes final</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fe3bd2269b9a9ada" source="e_95ca511e62a67079" target="e_ccb9c0114a2220f3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">patch</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_10386ff45bb958ee</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">until an official patch or upgrade is issued</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b67c119a92361861" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_34cf20183f45e324"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e0389d3906ac4fad</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f4ab3539842c39f" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_d068a0aa82ac3043"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8f1b31a07439e543</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d913deb8687d3420" source="e_66e4de79357567de" target="e_e916c75e8e43cbaf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">cause</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_17fe3a60388c2e72</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, an impact may be recognized as undesirable, but the root cause may not be known</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_5f27328d8bc09b1f" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_33214aeb432b738b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8c9cd959e3074206</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgement by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_2d3f2e4ad1b5586d" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_298a9593b67b7b1f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through acknowledgement by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e5b1536fa53bcfd7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgement by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_1d93c212e4ec370c" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_cf4606d100a09d0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is known to exist with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_acd8eaaffb0276e9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The urgency of a vulnerability is higher when a vulnerability is known to exist with certainty</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_475b827260d54088" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_3655237b10b88be1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">suggests</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_262ccbb686f6387e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric also suggests the level of technical knowledge available to would-be attackers</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3c3becb2a204e990" source="e_08068329a4aeab79" target="e_44d2eca1baada6ea"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploits</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d426ae288caeb826</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Detailed reports exist, or functional reproduction is possible (functional exploits may provide this)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f09e37f66ab37585" source="e_85c80081a7316fe3" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_45a02d6818f54734</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_30615f295ef5fef9" source="e_2143529daa2581e9" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a04ed201156156d6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2657a909c6edd94f" source="e_91741b8d6b014315" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7315fd8243b6fc68</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5fb8e9df1aee6125" source="e_dc1a92928d8fd579" target="e_a8467b3b679857f9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">install</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7c92a83da01cb92c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Customers who cannot immediately install the security update can take one of the following actions, depending on their environment:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_26d77920cd448b66" source="e_556b627b7c43e3ef" target="e_9ffb7cbec78fa95f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do use</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e1ffa661f34fc3b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Block inbound traffic on UDP ports 500 and 4500 for systems that do not use IKE</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_483f4a114e1af4ba" source="e_5d5372b986026500" target="e_5ed1bb6674bf66cb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be allow inbound traffic on UDP ports only from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_168f662659868e91</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For systems that require IKE, configure firewall rules to allow inbound traffic on UDP ports 500 and 4500 only from known peer addresses</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_215766a50e1719c2" source="e_556b627b7c43e3ef" target="e_9ffb7cbec78fa95f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_33274a8e3bc54a6f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For systems that require IKE, configure firewall rules to allow inbound traffic on UDP ports 500 and 4500 only from known peer addresses</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_65d1234b6e631d45" source="e_0e94d80f0d0a20ab" target="e_e033143dbdb056eb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">reduce</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_53bdf58b90f617de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These actions reduce the attack surface but do not replace installing the security update</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a2a3929e179c74af" source="e_0e94d80f0d0a20ab" target="e_cd02294221b23956"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do replace</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_19c0f4af0d1da3b6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These actions reduce the attack surface but do not replace installing the security update</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6017bd1de06fe24b" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e6ea9426b35f8856</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">How could an attacker exploit this vulnerability?</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_16a1d3b3eb38c7cd" source="e_e34c73ce7cdf1ddd" target="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">send crafted packets to Windows machine with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bc46b9584d9a47da</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An unauthenticated attacker could send specially crafted packets to a Windows machine with Internet Key Exchange (IKE) version 2 enabled, which could enable remote code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4de00a3e65a3d071" source="e_e34c73ce7cdf1ddd" target="e_666e09d333cc307c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">send</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b7b7b362d04d0353</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An unauthenticated attacker could send specially crafted packets to a Windows machine with Internet Key Exchange (IKE) version 2 enabled, which could enable remote code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_5b0aa2712ca32cb9" source="e_b82be424e7d21f94" target="e_a7523256c9515f68"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7035b8aebf3f79b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An unauthenticated attacker could send specially crafted packets to a Windows machine with Internet Key Exchange (IKE) version 2 enabled, which could enable remote code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_0aeaa7b773a304b1" source="e_a1dcdd289f57b065" target="e_15c6d0b1e60c9c9a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">protect customers through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_68310d5a9f511284</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft recognizes the efforts of those in the security community who help us protect customers through coordinated vulnerability disclosure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3a500d1644c2a32e" source="e_a1dcdd289f57b065" target="e_dc1a92928d8fd579"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">protect</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_19f4e3a980cfd264</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft recognizes the efforts of those in the security community who help us protect customers through coordinated vulnerability disclosure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3c7b023bea833793" source="e_8e81ce852cc92461" target="e_84268809b8f931f7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">recognizes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_db32464e74b47bc2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft recognizes the efforts of those in the security community who help us protect customers through coordinated vulnerability disclosure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b1505b84be283172" source="e_5859187b0a390a8a" target="e_7371f0fd94e813e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provided</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_37e37ba625dc769e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The information provided in the Microsoft Knowledge Base is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1581074afdcec8f0" source="e_9f13e30fa831fb5b" target="e_126f875dc12c3db5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">have been advised of possibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e932ab5630a1a1c3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In no event shall Microsoft Corporation or its suppliers be liable for any damages whatsoever including direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, loss of business profits or special damages, even if Microsoft Corporation or its suppliers have been advised of the possibility of such damages</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d15e951c1c160c0b" source="e_5843f0b3893d5cec" target="e_126f875dc12c3db5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">have been advised of possibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3a528f78ea4b226e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In no event shall Microsoft Corporation or its suppliers be liable for any damages whatsoever including direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, loss of business profits or special damages, even if Microsoft Corporation or its suppliers have been advised of the possibility of such damages</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fe598a43c2a1c01f" source="e_ebf0ea69dfcb9176" target="e_448ea7fbd1aed0cf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do not allow</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0b57fb57d789e842</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Some states do not allow the exclusion or limitation of liability for consequential or incidental damages so the foregoing limitation may not apply</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b23227aeb4f6e99d" source="e_5c980ac08d8e06db" target="e_422ecd83d8fd548b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_36ea1328e61fd351</data><data key="edge_source_id">S07</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S07_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">How satisfied are you with the MSRC Security Update Guide?</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3dabf531d9ef5538" source="e_056762b3f0d13b70" target="e_2da887c9a54f6ac7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be affecting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_289fb4b2b54da985</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">On July 14, 2026, Rapid7 and Microsoft disclosed CVE-2026-55040, an authentication bypass vulnerability affecting Microsoft SharePoint</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d29553afc63c087a" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_8914ea73282ff98a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are publishing technical analysis of vulnerability along with accompanying proof-of-concept script</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_739086388632de2e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Today we are publishing a technical analysis of the vulnerability along with an accompanying proof-of-concept (PoC) script</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_bb68c0bcb84161c1" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_af9e836f553eb905"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are publishing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_649d37dd51594bf7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Today we are publishing a technical analysis of the vulnerability along with an accompanying proof-of-concept (PoC) script</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_425099d842713a8c" source="e_be7a6e5c836d5c4e" target="e_eca3ff091a22d7d0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exists in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_03bfd742cc5b8005</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A critical authentication bypass vulnerability exists in SharePoint Server Subscription Edition's JWT token validation pipeline</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_916424803487076d" source="e_7b01f3c127e786ab" target="e_4a68b44291d658d4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is based upon</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_18f3ea45f592da53</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The below analysis is based upon decompilation and code review of the Microsoft.SharePoint.IdentityModel module from a fully patched SharePoint Server Subscription Edition instance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a4c270fbc51a5fff" source="e_7b01f3c127e786ab" target="e_49f13115e9ff0ecd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is based upon</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_68ff924a6708c009</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The below analysis is based upon decompilation and code review of the Microsoft.SharePoint.IdentityModel module from a fully patched SharePoint Server Subscription Edition instance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_aa0e9610f35b39fa" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_c5709770f6576cc4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">resides in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b8ca7e8e2afd9fd3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ae301f243dfd5c47" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_5e915c1a4e957b7b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">resides in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4711bedc7b87c3b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5c3c880ef5fd83e0" source="e_c5709770f6576cc4" target="e_c14cac9c7ee8b541"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implement token parsing for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_175d65eb69401dda</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3350aa0d28b5b167" source="e_c5709770f6576cc4" target="e_71ac8e151b57b1d9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implement</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_54763ee546625597</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_55c7346363ab996f" source="e_5e915c1a4e957b7b" target="e_c14cac9c7ee8b541"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implement token parsing for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c450099b8bdb2287</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5d217982f2bbec44" source="e_5e915c1a4e957b7b" target="e_71ac8e151b57b1d9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implement</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ab4aff3bb4f102cc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability resides in the SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2 class and its base class SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2, which together implement the token parsing and validation logic for Bearer service-to-service (S2S) tokens</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c5b21b5a7ee1d6ab" source="e_c5bc2eee5a4027b0" target="e_029f7bbb28bce08c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">uses</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d66d2e148c009ab1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">SharePoint's S2S authentication uses a nested JWT structure: an outer token containing user identity claims, and an inner "actor token" embedded in the actortoken claim</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b0826e2fd2b2b43e" source="e_8c2e65be6661f517" target="e_c1ee6299041a44a1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">represents</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c3b33b31618bd5bf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor token represents the calling application and is expected to be cryptographically signed by a trusted certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_05d4cccbada896fe" source="e_8c2e65be6661f517" target="e_137cb2a8e14bd3d8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be signed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ad0110502d11d389</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor token represents the calling application and is expected to be cryptographically signed by a trusted certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0b204503bd3199bd" source="e_609cc4fac6795e24" target="e_16dd9159f4f71caf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">begins in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9d8f138854e337eb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The validation flow begins in SPApplicationAuthenticationModuleV2.TryExtractAndValidateToken(), which extracts the Bearer token from the Authorization header, parses it via SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2.ReadToken(), and then validates it via SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2.ValidateToken()</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6101feb72a6534db" source="e_b82be424e7d21f94" target="e_de0c3d287c57fa3e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">extracts Bearer token from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_78e2c7d22e1132d3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The validation flow begins in SPApplicationAuthenticationModuleV2.TryExtractAndValidateToken(), which extracts the Bearer token from the Authorization header, parses it via SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2.ReadToken(), and then validates it via SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2.ValidateToken()</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d105cb0de9c629d6" source="e_29220089943c202b" target="e_6552561d836c55d3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">stack below</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5a503ef606ba4d34</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The debugger call stack below shows the call stack at the time of calling ValidateToken</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c5104418ea0b9b7c" source="e_50269ab6fd8fff23" target="e_6552561d836c55d3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">stack at time of calling ValidateToken</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_804c1ef0c3ed4c7e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The debugger call stack below shows the call stack at the time of calling ValidateToken</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_535b110dabaca421" source="e_50269ab6fd8fff23" target="e_6552561d836c55d3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">stack</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_05c3d0f9397ddbd3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The debugger call stack below shows the call stack at the time of calling ValidateToken</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d03c4b9c1ce5b5da" source="e_78fa85289ca7d809" target="e_d8d85d45361688ea"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is System.Web.HttpApplication httpApplication out</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b37d99edce40fcd5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft.SharePoint.IdentityModel.dll!Microsoft.SharePoint.IdentityModel.SPApplicationAuthenticationModuleV2.ConstructIClaimsPrincipalAndSetThreadIdentity(System.Web.HttpApplication httpApplication, System.Web.HttpContext httpContext, Microsoft.SharePoint.IdentityModel.SPFederationAuthenticationModuleV2 fam, out string tokenType) (IL≈0x0041, Native=0x00007FFC730A1860+0xB2)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e7b977f75a2cd4c6" source="e_d2a71286d764e423" target="e_90f00c653abed9cc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0b1b58b043a44abc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The first and most fundamental weakness is in SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2.ValidateToken()</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c02526f0f81c5c39" source="e_79493022c981a526" target="e_90f00c653abed9cc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_97cf65bec4e463f5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The first and most fundamental weakness is in SPJsonWebSecurityTokenHandlerV2.ValidateToken()</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_134fc87b5fd7ce97" source="e_426b658f3b89fe49" target="e_6270a5fe85b02b15"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disables</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6ab0cfe6d4386608</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This single line disables the JWT library's cryptographic signature verification</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_631e378d3b8776ce" source="e_4dc239162c062c58" target="e_be1d1afeaf3bf685"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepts tokens with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_371776625ff7315e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When RequireSignedTokens is false, the library accepts tokens with alg: none in the header, meaning no signature is required on the outer token at all</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8057ab923bbc814a" source="e_4dc239162c062c58" target="e_6d3a01919cc8a376"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">parses</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_89c17ed2923d7090</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The library still parses the JWT and populates claims, but never performs any cryptographic verification of the outer token</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_cde3da6ad1af7dbf" source="e_4dc239162c062c58" target="e_fd07dfd527e1eef3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">populates</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c5bf90121950638c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The library still parses the JWT and populates claims, but never performs any cryptographic verification of the outer token</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3c5a93c570883233" source="e_791de43fccfd7f2f" target="e_ab3cd50a45b1d187"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implements own validation logic in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b00d581f16513b91</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1] and [2], the built-in audience and issuer validation from the JWT library are also disabled, SharePoint implements its own validation logic in separate methods</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_079d0a4a346082f9" source="e_791de43fccfd7f2f" target="e_04ea785bb869ef93"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">implements own validation logic</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_538ef63c2eadc508</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1] and [2], the built-in audience and issuer validation from the JWT library are also disabled, SharePoint implements its own validation logic in separate methods</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_107cc5e677b2b2bd" source="e_6d3a01919cc8a376" target="e_9be68c2bd53557a6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">resolves</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e7fabca7a36e1c2b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">After ReadToken() parses the JWT, SharePoint's custom validation code resolves the actor token's signing key using the x5t (X.509 certificate thumbprint) header</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a30a67204537ae48" source="e_62660f06eadde947" target="e_4e18b7c973332b55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be using</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_472bafcacfa58096</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">After ReadToken() parses the JWT, SharePoint's custom validation code resolves the actor token's signing key using the x5t (X.509 certificate thumbprint) header</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4ce96f2bf9253b37" source="e_e163460c91338b08" target="e_48c28aa625a52497"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">occurs / / in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f9b43b215b8d519a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This occurs in SPJsonWebSecurityBaseTokenHandlerV2:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e79c1b2e37e453d1" source="e_776f1d61b93551a8" target="e_de4f2aa066892746"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">extracts / / directly</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d4d79d6b58228522</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1], the call to GetSigningKeyIdentifier extracts the x5t value directly from the actor token's JWT header:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_19b44ef0332b0251" source="e_776f1d61b93551a8" target="e_4a440f0d7f548662"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">extracts / / x5t value from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bc8dfa66aa0b0d1a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1], the call to GetSigningKeyIdentifier extracts the x5t value directly from the actor token's JWT header:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3bbb39249d87676f" source="e_776f1d61b93551a8" target="e_de4f2aa066892746"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">extracts / /</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_176252e2bb413c8a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1], the call to GetSigningKeyIdentifier extracts the x5t value directly from the actor token's JWT header:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7f56ae8d8942bc8a" source="e_8da41769d43e04b2" target="e_a808ba19b12ca174"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is x5t out</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b6012ac29e71d46e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">if (!((Dictionary&lt;string, object&gt;)(object)header).TryGetValue("x5t", out object value))</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e3bd4a6b83f02401" source="e_00af3570796b3644" target="e_fe22e3a9aa67dbf9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is SecurityKeyIdentifierClause keyIdentifierClause out</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a644878f874f9b2c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">protected override bool TryResolveTokenCore(SecurityKeyIdentifierClause keyIdentifierClause, out SecurityToken token)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8a59c56615232234" source="e_b4ce5f620e5b18e6" target="e_5a32f80e837928a3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is local.LocalLoginProvider out</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cd32f77156edce7f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">if (TryResolveTokenCoreWithAccessProvider(local.LocalLoginProvider, keyIdentifierClause, out token)) // &lt;--- [4]</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b699bc67d6e281f3" source="e_b6a53f52ebc04f31" target="e_0c150b2def074ef8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">finds</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_764975be758e4d93</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If an attacker sets the actor token's x5t header to the thumbprint of SharePoint's STS certificate, the resolver finds a match and returns an X509SecurityToken wrapping that certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1cde0b3fbfcddfa0" source="e_b6a53f52ebc04f31" target="e_026bfb840de73973"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">returns X509SecurityToken wrapping that</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fb22b365d6f73b17</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If an attacker sets the actor token's x5t header to the thumbprint of SharePoint's STS certificate, the resolver finds a match and returns an X509SecurityToken wrapping that certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_25541275415b9941" source="e_fe0f55e3693d0848" target="e_026bfb840de73973"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be wrapping that</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_90ae1448009e465f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If an attacker sets the actor token's x5t header to the thumbprint of SharePoint's STS certificate, the resolver finds a match and returns an X509SecurityToken wrapping that certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6d59d6ca0296ab24" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_e5b86ea3768bb695"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">sets actor token 's x5t header to thumbprint of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d7a09a2c1cfacf19</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If an attacker sets the actor token's x5t header to the thumbprint of SharePoint's STS certificate, the resolver finds a match and returns an X509SecurityToken wrapping that certificate</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_462baa28780a9f53" source="e_e45e9f74aa5b2695" target="e_4a440f0d7f548662"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is assigned to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_76396c713ec7f1e3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [3], this token is assigned to the actor token's SigningToken property</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_30e6806578ffbfd6" source="e_0a74ab6b8c124112" target="e_6620f7434e7041fd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">resolves key from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_19165c85042b2df3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The code resolves the key from x5t, populates SigningToken, but never calls any signature verification function</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c8c1fe86485e135" source="e_0a74ab6b8c124112" target="e_322ea3c423e4f628"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">populates</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_049889c464a6b4f5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The code resolves the key from x5t, populates SigningToken, but never calls any signature verification function</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c30e73adad883ac1" source="e_bb4cb9064eb1e9dc" target="e_b2ed8f50f54e96cb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepts</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f367cebd69d120fe</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Weakness 3: Issuer validation accepts unregistered certificates</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_24bc80321d61d5f0" source="e_0a74ab6b8c124112" target="e_f6e99be2f87c673f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">proceeds to call</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_32bb192eb657dd99</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">After setting the actor token's SigningToken, the code proceeds to call ValidateIssuer(token)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_409164895542a42f" source="e_0dd1994901856e68" target="e_bd7685a85c5377bd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">contains</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4dc33648e363e022</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For a token that contains an actor token SigningToken value (which we just achieved above), the logic in ValidateIssuer takes the below path:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_cb0dd064a95ec7ed" source="e_e163460c91338b08" target="e_b714a5923e95ecac"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">calls</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_57240a0f4e3805b7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This calls the ValidateIssuer(X509SecurityToken, string) overload which accepts tokens signed by unregistered certificates:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_acefb0b7cc437112" source="e_b714a5923e95ecac" target="e_b2ed8f50f54e96cb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepts tokens signed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_42b17622a31739ad</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This calls the ValidateIssuer(X509SecurityToken, string) overload which accepts tokens signed by unregistered certificates:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_06490357897013bc" source="e_b12b45dceecb4419" target="e_b2ed8f50f54e96cb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be signed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_66357d52ce2b5588</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This calls the ValidateIssuer(X509SecurityToken, string) overload which accepts tokens signed by unregistered certificates:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_07b0174ac81a3bd0" source="e_8ddf64f1bb84f0d7" target="e_864e4fc9e52bbb7f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepted</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b282cc7ceb245070</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">ULS.SendTraceTag(594416645u, ..., "ValidateTokenIssuer accepted Issuer '{0}' because " +</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fd031cd553432faa" source="e_0a74ab6b8c124112" target="e_b0b8500294aa8ce2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">searches TrustedSecurityTokenServices collection for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_50645ce7a0acfdf3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1] above, the code searches the TrustedSecurityTokenServices collection for a provider whose signing certificate matches</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_879963dd92c9c096" source="e_0a74ab6b8c124112" target="e_5f5de0835a976bcc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">searches</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5efe9327694c16cc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [1] above, the code searches the TrustedSecurityTokenServices collection for a provider whose signing certificate matches</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f2d31d1342b82d34" source="e_f0d5912cb84b2ed4" target="e_d433e56f8865336c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">belongs to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_61b52b41dca911f4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">SharePoint's local STS signing certificate belongs to the LocalLoginProvider access provider, which is not in the TrustedSecurityTokenServices collection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0d153e5c53a2b634" source="e_d433e56f8865336c" target="e_5f5de0835a976bcc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a746a9d2cefaa497</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">SharePoint's local STS signing certificate belongs to the LocalLoginProvider access provider, which is not in the TrustedSecurityTokenServices collection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_428ae749853dd637" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_76d335b09e8a84be"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepts</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bb34306406c84505</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [2], when the result is null, the method accepts the issuer unconditionally and returns to the caller instead of throwing a SecurityTokenException exception</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d5168f1b003b2cce" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_3c7094273c34a423"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">accepts issuer</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cdd9dd6e0288b9ea</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [2], when the result is null, the method accepts the issuer unconditionally and returns to the caller instead of throwing a SecurityTokenException exception</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d29715a2d77d4ae6" source="e_5ab3192545a9989c" target="e_a5b5b8dfe495beff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is called during</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8b62b2b7d0162288</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The final validation step involves GetTokenSignature, which is called during session token construction</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4b8068eaaac43364" source="e_fff6f340350e70b2" target="e_5ab3192545a9989c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">involves</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7598474e55cd2bd8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The final validation step involves GetTokenSignature, which is called during session token construction</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b1ee7f80fc28cc03" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_28c49f13603714ee"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">requires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0d78af54442dc6c6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This method requires a non-empty signature but performs no cryptographic verification:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0f79c1c1d702720c" source="e_333716f10a881b90" target="e_8c2e65be6661f517"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">recurses into</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f1c77de93e15caf0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At [2], the method recurses into the actor token</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_794e6aa650bc5255" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_dc5970cd22feb889"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">returns</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b3099107fa344fce</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The actor token's signature is AAAA, a non-empty string, so at [3] it returns "AAAA" without any cryptographic verification that this value is a valid RSA signature</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fdb7f3f833adca2e" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_be1d1afeaf3bf685"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">sends JWT with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_345e7976118b5d5c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Attacker sends a JWT with alg: none in the outer header, so no signature is required in the outer token</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4c4e952e06c52cac" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_6d3a01919cc8a376"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">sends</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7491a09a8bd9ab34</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Attacker sends a JWT with alg: none in the outer header, so no signature is required in the outer token</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_54ff7522d3cba424" source="e_79c3661ff45bf137" target="e_4a440f0d7f548662"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">contains SharePoint 's own STS certificate thumbprint</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_df98f181eb9e499b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- The actor token's x5t header contains SharePoint's own STS certificate thumbprint, allowing us to resolve a signing key with no verification</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f9a9ea67dffa2aa" source="e_99b0fcf4270030e5" target="e_1ce067cc343c1192"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is in TrustedSecurityTokenServices</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_82521ae850feb270</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- The resolved certificate is not in TrustedSecurityTokenServices, allowing the issuer to be accepted</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data><