e_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In order to know the x5t value to use in the inner actortoken token, we must first retrieve the x509 certificate of the STS signing certificate from the target SharePoint site</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9c50dc063d23b0aa" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_c48df64d61c7d4f6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">retrieve x509 certificate of STS signing certificate In to know</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_000169feaaf85c9b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In order to know the x5t value to use in the inner actortoken token, we must first retrieve the x509 certificate of the STS signing certificate from the target SharePoint site</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6a36b9533a290468" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_1a51f9c86c7ba790"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">retrieve x509 certificate of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_84f9cb7f32411fce</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In order to know the x5t value to use in the inner actortoken token, we must first retrieve the x509 certificate of the STS signing certificate from the target SharePoint site</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c2bdb6731f781001" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_593bcf40ea5f4a99"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">retrieve x509 certificate of STS signing certificate from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4ba0998dd4709604</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In order to know the x5t value to use in the inner actortoken token, we must first retrieve the x509 certificate of the STS signing certificate from the target SharePoint site</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7aa10b7d748fb9f3" source="e_b82be424e7d21f94" target="e_f3d3c66327549613"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">returns STS signing certificate as part of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_520f8a4635e159a9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Which returns the STS signing certificate as part of the response:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_dfff8c21276c316b" source="e_b82be424e7d21f94" target="e_1a51f9c86c7ba790"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">returns</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1221184d2e1a815e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Which returns the STS signing certificate as part of the response:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_dfe09880f13a1aed" source="e_289013757f982692" target="e_dc75915be7b58f9d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is shown below For</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6ed8694dee5e761b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C08</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For completeness, the parsed x509 certificate is shown below</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6ac02a2e7d487a99" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_6620f7434e7041fd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">compute</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d1f59856bfa0f25e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S08</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/ra-microsoft-sharepoint-jwt-token-authentication-bypass-cve-2026-55040/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S08_C09</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Using the above x509 certificate, we can compute the x5t by base64 decoding the entire x509 certificate, computing the SHA1 digest value, then base64 encoding that raw digest value</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_85c7b1c2ac2c8a4d" source="e_35400971c008bd74" target="e_47869b8