vidence">A Method is something we would usually define in a model to do something, like “get a specific value from the database.” In the Method, the two important bits inside of the Method are Parameter and MethodInstance</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_bd4fcd7202468bef" source="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2" target="e_333716f10a881b90"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defines argument for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_eda80cd4858a7c33</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Parameter defines an argument for a Method, or a return type for the Method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0adef042fa6788fc" source="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2" target="e_105e1f9e7fc2fc5b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">defines</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_84501e2cd46a3a4a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A Parameter defines an argument for a Method, or a return type for the Method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_47bcb7dcf99cdde1" source="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2" target="e_8ff96d8bed470e80"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">indicates</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_235c019945fc0bb5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Parameter mostly indicates whether it is an input or output value</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ddb71ce276795d6a" source="e_6528b59578cac1f9" target="e_05a359b3cdf8c0f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">define DefaultValues for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_57c3c7b41850baca</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A TypeDescriptor can also define DefaultValues for the parameter so we don’t need to pass them as arguments to the method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_364dac18fab0d07a" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_21b08d533d49d334"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d09471bdaf001d17</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.vulncheck.com/blog/cve-2026-63520-sharepoint-unsafe-type-rce</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S10_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A TypeDescriptor can also define DefaultValues for the parameter so we don’t need to pass them as arguments to the method</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_25c12968f678d6bc" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_f8b520c0a0b6460f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do need to pass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b2ba46cb98c28f14</data><data key="edge_source_id">S10</data><data key