e</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2fb192755a249940" source="e_f72b45612317d7b9" target="e_666ed72f59d3b5c5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be instructing DeepSeek to use actor 's fofoapi.py script for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_255f1b2a8f95f4ef</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- fofa-cyberspace-search: a custom procedure template instructing DeepSeek to use the actor's fofoapi.py script for internet asset enumeration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c9d8d130d36a051" source="e_f72b45612317d7b9" target="e_9415737df43b825d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be instructing DeepSeek to use</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_337c3230295595bf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- fofa-cyberspace-search: a custom procedure template instructing DeepSeek to use the actor's fofoapi.py script for internet asset enumeration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_10c3d10ff25723ec" source="e_f272aadb8d266e64" target="e_bbcb8ea999353380"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">scan</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ba734cb5bea8a0ec</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Nuclei scan generation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_226df4d25487f417" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_876e97cebfd6b85c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">recovered following sequence from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c0d622c6e2fc4af1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We recovered the following sequence in Figure 1 from a single Hermes Agent session (May 7, 2026)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_488b6a4be7e0da64" source="e_be74ffef073dc8d3" target="e_14d62c8ebe4c3dd9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">recovered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_722e32f5a3778a5b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">We recovered the following sequence in Figure 1 from a single Hermes Agent session (May 7, 2026)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_0854fe107296b712" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_3e93d7bb7f0e0264"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">identified</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8a2cd3c81cfd174f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">DeepSeek identified a Langflow vulnerability (CVE-2026-33017, CVSS 9.8) and autonomously attempted exploitation through the following steps:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_286f649696a12fcd" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_3439326c903f4c24"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">identified attempted exploitation through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_94020ff9f04c64fc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">DeepSeek identified a Langflow vulnerability (CVE-2026-33017, CVSS 9.8) and autonomously attempted exploitation through the following steps:</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_67df81ebb6d1f90e" source="e_3a786607c0f2f54e" target="e_65b2834b7db6279c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_486f78952a249aa9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Downloading the public PoC exploit from GitHub</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_90822cd3343d6130" source="e_99da2e7b350f41ef" target="e_33455d9e26137cce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">requires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4299994f7e460ad2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_