dence">The cloned code is non-functional with placeholder values that cannot achieve code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9661021684864867" source="e_b6bed0aadec9b7fe" target="e_d273cb70ce73d149"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is non-functional with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0aec500bdb82a223</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The cloned code is non-functional with placeholder values that cannot achieve code execution</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e49697542fc542a9" source="e_3bd688b4f7b9a90b" target="e_b2d69f70a83ee969"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">allow</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_039b4a024ca90b2d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">What’s interesting is that the actor appeared to allow DeepSeek to narrow the targeting scope, likely to conserve AI compute</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_faeb8808133245b9" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_2fca61518b1f3778"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be checking version via</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8ea6f941ed7e7a26</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Of those 100 systems, it probed roughly 40 unique IP addresses, checking their version via curl commands</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_22b29cf78da3f352" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_08453407addef528"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">found attempted to exploit them automatically</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f461feb4b83a060a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While most of the systems were unreachable or non-responsive, DeepSeek found three with the vulnerable versions and attempted to exploit them automatically</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ed30ae17d947016f" source="e_28a64b697e4cbab5" target="e_7764b8b24f6c0608"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">found</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cd276ad9a27c4ad4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C05</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While most of the systems were unreachable or non-responsive, DeepSeek found three with the vulnerable versions and attempted to exploit them automatically</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5bf217ed7e6585ea" source="e_9679aaa8fc0d06f9" target="e_4d27518fe5929d86"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is notable while managing own autonomous process of