tion</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_45354cf426bba74d" source="e_618d93742ee02dc6" target="e_2b74a6a4bd535719"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">was prevented by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_41f0d7ff40d5b367</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C06</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Autonomous AI-driven attack cycles are operationally viable, and the margin of failure was narrow: Exploitation was prevented by target-side configuration requirements — the absence of prerequisite workflow configurations (Langflow) and authentication on form endpoints (n8n)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_883a295034fce4fa" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_d80b6d35ff4f4235"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure Rather than using AI tools in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f2e50678fae786de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_87cc1006d8f169b7" source="e_ff0251d80d2ce1d2" target="e_a286b3bec1094d96"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are constructing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_453cd4abfd77042d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5cf0a6c35684a71a" source="e_b318349d684cc484" target="e_47ea552dd1dc99e6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be designed to retain successful procedures across</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7defe18fdcdd3b07</data><data key="edge_source_id">S16</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/autonomous-ai-cyber-attack-campaign/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S16_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Threat actors are constructing persistent AI offensive infrastructure: Rather than using AI tools in isolation, this actor assembled an integrated environment — custom automation skills, MCP server integration, proxy anonymization, and Telegram-based command and control — designed to retain and reuse successful procedures across sessions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ba304b35321c6269" source="e_b318349d684cc484" target="e_a3cd32f2410c31ce"><data key="edge