a key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_db4416a87784783f" source="e_8ea2d5e84baadda6" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">lead to unauthenticated remote code execution against vulnerable SharePoint server</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b7e21e945964ed4d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S18</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-sharepoint-cve-2026-55040-poc-exploit/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When paired with another vulnerability, CVE-2026-63520, CVE-2026-55040 “could lead to unauthenticated remote code execution against a vulnerable SharePoint server”, according to NHS England Digital</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_9f024c2e8cf58fcb" source="e_8ea2d5e84baadda6" target="e_fbfb70a00355d68e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">lead to unauthenticated remote code execution against vulnerable SharePoint server</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3b656f17a66af78f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S18</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-sharepoint-cve-2026-55040-poc-exploit/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When paired with another vulnerability, CVE-2026-63520, CVE-2026-55040 “could lead to unauthenticated remote code execution against a vulnerable SharePoint server”, according to NHS England Digital</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d0bbcb6428371ab7" source="e_086aa5bfb79357b0" target="e_f72c254fb6de88cb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">were urged to follow</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6a13a529f5718e7f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S18</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-sharepoint-cve-2026-55040-poc-exploit/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Defenders were also urged to follow Microsoft’s official SharePoint hardening documentation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_cb1d9a57352bbb20" source="e_9cab417cdfb025e8" target="e_98419d6c0bf73fb9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">requires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b41fa198d042a0d2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S18</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-sharepoint-cve-2026-55040-poc-exploit/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">“Avoid exposing SharePoint Servers directly to the internet unless necessary; and if necessary, only configure a SharePoint Server behind a Layer 7 reverse proxy or equivalent application-layer security control that requires authentication and can inspect and filter requests,” CISA wrote</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_a19f41b00b9e2aba" source="e_6f7684418f21aa11" target="e_9cab417cdfb025e8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">wrote if necessary configure SharePoint Server behind</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b13fdfe994bbe1de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S18</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/13/microsoft-sharepoint-cve-2026-55040-poc-exploit/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">“Avoid exposing SharePoint Servers directly to the internet unless necessary; and if necessary, only configure a SharePoint Server behind a Layer 