pact for every CVE ID through services such as the Vulnrichment Program</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b789775d3569626c" source="e_6f7684418f21aa11" target="e_28b516a2fc53c300"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">publishes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1245244d2d7780be</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">CISA publishes answers to KEV Status, Exploit Automation, and Technical Impact for every CVE ID through services such as the Vulnrichment Program</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f6403cdb91eb5cf4" source="e_6f7684418f21aa11" target="e_67a70e0ba699f3ef"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">developed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_53bd409001dea2d9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additionally, CISA developed Implementation Guidance: Prioritizing Security Updates Based on Risk to support agencies in implementing this Directive</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2449f062b2d8e53f" source="e_f815e0f3f0982d43" target="e_48147ae8d892f17e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Based on Risk to support agencies in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9ab1e9ce301ee5ab</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additionally, CISA developed Implementation Guidance: Prioritizing Security Updates Based on Risk to support agencies in implementing this Directive</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_64164341b02deb5b" source="e_f815e0f3f0982d43" target="e_20617c6c62d27119"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Based on Risk to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_891409d4fc1a3cdc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additionally, CISA developed Implementation Guidance: Prioritizing Security Updates Based on Risk to support agencies in implementing this Directive</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e0e346e91be95007" source="e_f815e0f3f0982d43" target="e_48147ae8d892f17e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Based to support agencies in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f589667944fe148f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additionally, CISA developed Implementation Guidance: Prioritizing Security Updates Based on Risk to support agencies in implementing this Directive</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8df15d6c71e6ce90" source="e_f815e0f3f0982d43" target="e_20617c6c62d27119"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Based to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5affa47b7e161887</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additionally, CISA developed Implementation Guidance: Prioritizing Security Updates Based on Risk to support agencies in implementing this Directive</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c2c42daf87e8b048" source="e_51818b24578076d6" target="e_25d8fa9e056c2ca4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">establishes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3241d80489b7c409</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The requirements in this Directive align with Office of Management and Budget (OMB) Circular A-130:1 Managing Information as a Strategic Resource, which establishes policy for the management of federal information resources</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_062196f99e0d7056" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_2606dadb315931b4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">emphasizes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_39496f0533339074</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It emphasizes robust vulnerability management practices, continuous monitoring requirements, and coordination with CISA pursuant to the Federal Information Security Modernization Act (FISMA) of 2014.2 This Directive also advances priorities for securing federal government networks set forth in Executive Order (EO) Promoting Advanced Artificial Intelligence Innovation and Security3 and the Cyber Strategy for America</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3d16808aa32b506d" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_98d6bfc414a84e9c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">emphasizes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_052f543498dec7d0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It emphasizes robust vulnerability management practices, continuous monitoring requirements, and coordination with CISA pursuant to the Federal Information Security Modernization Act (FISMA) of 2014.2 This Directive also advances priorities for securing federal government networks set forth in Executive Order (EO) Promoting Advanced Artificial Intelligence Innovation and Security3 and the Cyber Strategy for America</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d61834600018ff76" source="e_431e373eb7dbce94" target="e_e99746f20846c799"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">set in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_69c5e00f15ed4367</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data>