es BOD 19-02: Vulnerability Remediation Requirements for Internet-Accessible Systems (April 29, 2019), and BOD 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (Nov. 3, 2021)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a6b1e2accd785b50" source="e_2f2483ca9ac5ab40" target="e_a66291a00a58606a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">gives</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_78ed9382e58981c1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Partial control:5 One of the following is true: The exploit gives the threat actor limited control over, or information exposure about, the behavior of the software that contains the vulnerability; or the exploit gives the threat actor a low stochastic opportunity for total control</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1eb45cec7e01729d" source="e_e676ec664a2d737c" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">contains</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_45af7b3db2d403bb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S19</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/directives/bod-26-04-prioritizing-security-updates-based-risk</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S19_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Partial control:5 One of the following is true: The exploit gives the threat actor limited control over, or information exposure about, the behavior of the software that contains the vulnerability; or the exploit gives the threat actor a low stochastic opportunity for total control</data><data key="edge_extractio