larly, if a CVE Record is updated by the originating CNA to provide information that would impact the SSVC decision points, those SSVC decision points will be updated shortly thereafter by the CISA ADP</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7d13f73111321fa6" source="e_b823c9d95d8545ae" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is updated to provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8fb033f5eaf6cd5d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Similarly, if a CVE Record is updated by the originating CNA to provide information that would impact the SSVC decision points, those SSVC decision points will be updated shortly thereafter by the CISA ADP</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8f12033b2b790733" source="e_c1d9a7ea10178d63" target="e_65b2834b7db6279c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is available on CISA ADP website on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bc95c612c4dc938a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additional information about the CISA ADP, including contact information , is available on the CISA ADP website on GitHub</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d08cac6359c9e4e4" source="e_e676ec664a2d737c" target="e_ebffc430dc3d5487"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is made of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f223b5013288a900</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Software is made of other software</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1173bed4bd330e11" source="e_9fbb650c9c4cf522" target="e_bf054d1a762ad1ca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">mean</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_722766ec291cec3a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Variations in implementation, configuration, environment, and operational context can mean different downstream impacts</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_48c8e7adcc9fa07c" source="e_ca7ebda47a947869" target="e_bf054d1a762ad1ca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">mean</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6c25f37c629695ec</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Variations in implementation, configuration, environment, and operational context can mean different downstream impacts</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3f545adb8f5acdae" source="e_a6f7c7bc1a2471d6" target="e_bf054d1a762ad1ca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">mean</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4739fd380544a351</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Variations in implementation, configuration, environment, and operational context can mean different downstream impacts</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_84d7ef566e1a4950" source="e_5b4b6d14011f2516" target="e_bf054d1a762ad1ca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">mean</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3d6bce42b8caa708</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Variations in implementation, configuration, environment, and operational context can mean different downstream impacts</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_ac25090308e320d5" source="e_f011ad4bd061f6bc" target="e_d250f9ce596a7fc8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">publish</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1d53122cd1c36403</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To explore how CVE Records might be made more valuable to the downstream consumer by addressing this issue, the CVE Program is conducting a “ Supplier CVE Numbering Authority (CNA) as Authorized Data Publisher Pilot (SADP Pilot) ” from April 2026 through July 2026 (this end date may be extended) that explores enabling product suppliers the ability to publish authoritative product status information directly within CVE Records of upstream vulnerabilities, helping reduce unnecessary investigation and enabling more efficient vulnerability management workflows</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_0e7f7441d81b9bc7" source="e_aee10f6c7ed33a1e" target="e_685c6f473584e6f5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Wanted for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b9fe2fd90706222e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- Additional Supplier CNAs Wanted for Pilot – CVE Blog</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_af1a84fcd12639db" source="e_23b1f12635feadcf" target="e_fae454b8f6a57c6d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be added in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3061b0bee2c24f34</data><data key="edge_source_id">S38</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cve.org/ProgramOrganization/ADPs</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Additional ADPs may be added in the future</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_670f9ae69c198905" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_466e6377cc3c1257"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">reflects</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_77c00c23925054b7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric reflects the context by which vulnerability exploitation is possible</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_85a7852452677412" source="e_bf255aff8978049b" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be in to exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f7d5b7e4ea957483</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Base Score increases the more remote (logically, and physically) an attacker can be in order to exploit the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f4259de5ffd718a7" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_6222cbe778251f55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_55e11a6563e01ec9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a9dccd3e15008e1c" source="e_f18bdb19e94ba6dc" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exist in to exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fc98d147040ee123</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_98e9f89be1e3b660" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_01558e47b2eef8dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9f82e7c8f9f1f0c9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_9d37ac7d26c2adeb" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_7c2ea70eaaaaf7b7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0e86e13b4b2de197</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b80270ffe1b244a2" source="e_213a633d7417fc58" target="e_70d08b8077a5c72d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is required</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_11d4b582bbc04106</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If a specific configuration is required for an attack to succeed, the Base metrics should be scored assuming the vulnerable component is in that configuration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_41b86cea9e256f47" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expect repeatable success against</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3cb0bc9c05e35492</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker can expect repeatable success against the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3922abe7854e8bcf" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_6f4e9633d33400d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">expect</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bc3aad72b107f1c2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker can expect repeatable success against the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d569197310b91931" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes level of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_df82fabd89e430be</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4672b5c5626cfae5" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess before exploiting vulnerability</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_39d92a51c83234cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ca30f7b072aeb977" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_898126d8306a1f35</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f5166ba1f547dbc7" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_9bf6ead54114b2ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unauthorized prior to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_326c774ac04668ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker is unauthorized prior to attack, and therefore does not require any access to settings or files to carry out an attack</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3f06f5332be71788" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_4ff55a19c43dfad3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">captures</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8796fdc26067a83c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_977f5d8bea68d6c1" source="e_1c8a4e08eb9cf221" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be participate in successful compromise</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cba81e9941876ca4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_37d3ee327d9ae26a" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited at will of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_42544919eee7410f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_05d8d5b549208b3f" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_060bbd297383d5a7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9f34741c55488789</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_c1411a9818cb4164" source="e_544178d28761a5ab" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_63771ce0c8d221b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8926a27fbb154525" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c9a55194eecc2bf0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_61066dd9b4a208e1" source="e_4c8d801d68302e5b" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f9522a63ae1c50d3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d9dfd7dbd031e53f" source="e_3332b20efeafa93a" target="e_1e808dd568a942dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored relative to impacted component If</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1a326d70c08e9a06</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0b28378edb75be4e" source="e_544178d28761a5ab" target="e_3fba628e91443cb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6062d0232218915e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1a2c8ca587b0bb3d" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_3fba628e91443cb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ed7d4cd46ae3e3f0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c29f5d46e522ca4f" source="e_4c8d801d68302e5b" target="e_3fba628e91443cb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_57da17469209ebcc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d1d35c29d063b14e" source="e_3332b20efeafa93a" target="e_3fba628e91443cb6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be scored</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4914fe9851b8c377</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If so, the Base Score increases and the Confidentiality, Integrity and Authentication metrics should be scored relative to the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_256ec30d96b3fe94" source="e_87a35caaa98faf5a" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affect resources managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f6cdffcb5697cedb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_2436b097e81af28b" source="e_c4631f903e1159e5" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8d1086955a98cfae</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_e0e7abc00acf64d5" source="e_0651ca14b1e582f2" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_77f39d403bdc502e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_77ef5d43709ecbc0" source="e_26e0466f06957bd3" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a82df8bb4e202470</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7a03b583b5029479" source="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_160de405b71042b3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_310ed0d72dc086b1" source="e_841d5cae83210039" target="e_c1b8569aebaf6353"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c7d161f703b43c80</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the confidentiality of the information resources managed by a software component due to a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_66c4d7f88eeee69e" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_6e5ec707cbc044ff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_835d3f474ca85dfc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_20161a66be864488" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_8b2074bad160dde7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_373b6d5002aef488</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_85826a9fd4a36816" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_a15d5fd58349b1ad"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to preventing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_84661ce4962658eb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a97da462dbce887d" source="e_fabb36a448bb30b7" target="e_eb1797b298a230c0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disclosed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9a23b064a86c192f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, access to only some restricted information is obtained, but the disclosed information presents a direct, serious impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6d06e747abddd7f2" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to trustworthiness of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ba54192456ccf280</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c436113f29ea697" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_edea54677a8d7d64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c1a6b79eea784be7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2a6896e209a4b247" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_26e0466f06957bd3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3c6684d3477deafe</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_25d7eba7c0e4f5d5" source="e_332fd4a216e1c401" target="e_2228b2b192c550b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e95fd5aac9c7ad77</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the availability of the impacted component resulting from a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a2ca49c296364ea6" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_b6ca085d15d6ffbc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_66157ff5ed2624aa</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It refers to the loss of availability of the impacted component itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_757accb1fdd1dc2d" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_841d5cae83210039"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_429c9f59562f3695</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_61e6dd0ae89c619d" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_bf0bee0969a73481"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b92de3ef02ef43a4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_65075b2e4d7518d3" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_d37e8eb9896152d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4237ec861b1b578a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3bd6dc43af088533" source="e_22e800482ee5b5fd" target="e_4058f076b2d4719d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consume</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b467023717732ff4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_22c142afeb5a4c69" source="e_dd256f5f1485834f" target="e_7adbd4ff7f080bab"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0ee966dc77500e43</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the likelihood of the vulnerability being attacked, and is typically based on the current state of exploit techniques, public availability of exploit code, or active, 'in-the-wild' exploitation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ec833d7eb78d4983" source="e_527c56c7674a26dd" target="e_904da0b4f3960fb3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is important factor for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f21cacab29ee25f5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Remediation Level of a vulnerability is an important factor for prioritization</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9a93ed39cc6d3259" source="e_4228490cbf8a6d91" target="e_98c110f1e21aa4eb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unpatched when</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3b178d7e954d2a50</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The typical vulnerability is unpatched when initially published</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_beeb0f8ac8f65eca" source="e_791715a2772f6f50" target="e_ccb9c0114a2220f3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">patch</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1741a420caf3a32e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Workarounds or hotfixes may offer interim remediation until an official patch or upgrade is issued</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_aca6c058fd3876ec" source="e_edf56b768b8904e2" target="e_a568574ebde0ab4b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">becomes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ffc4ed9f706077af</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Each of these respective stages adjusts the temporal score downwards, reflecting the decreasing urgency as remediation becomes final</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e83034d7506ff79b" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_34cf20183f45e324"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_270f58df162325e2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_77d2203b6ef62ce9" source="e_298a9593b67b7b1f" target="e_d068a0aa82ac3043"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has issued</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4d58c3b08c186924</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Either the vendor has issued an official patch, or an upgrade is available</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0e4c63422d42d71c" source="e_edf56b768b8904e2" target="e_a568574ebde0ab4b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">becomes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_836c677df8ce2fe3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">decreasing urgency as remediation becomes final</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_22b767cb199682bf" source="e_66e4de79357567de" target="e_e916c75e8e43cbaf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">cause</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ab60849bcb829f64</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, an impact may be recognized as undesirable, but the root cause may not be known</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_81840f3e57a92807" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_33214aeb432b738b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_958bcd684d72da30</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgement by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f54696acb6ed6c3a" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_298a9593b67b7b1f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through acknowledgement by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_69ff2416eab968f8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgement by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_cab07cd736989cae" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_cf4606d100a09d0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is known to exist with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ebbae2ce04e054f9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The urgency of a vulnerability is higher when a vulnerability is known to exist with certainty</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4a5cfc1c8fef8e49" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_3655237b10b88be1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">suggests</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ba1885778da5fbac</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric also suggests the level of technical knowledge available to would-be attackers</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5835d3cd633ab694" source="e_08068329a4aeab79" target="e_44d2eca1baada6ea"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploits</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_450de6329a0159bb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Detailed reports exist, or functional reproduction is possible (functional exploits may provide this)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_de9e4156e324f248" source="e_85c80081a7316fe3" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bd20c166a2e97b43</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4f5127794c1b8b52" source="e_2143529daa2581e9" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9c92c93ef3d00b14</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e5b5e7088d9b6443" source="e_91741b8d6b014315" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has confirmed presence of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3a24f6a92c5766ac</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Source code is available to independently verify the assertions of the research, or the author or vendor of the affected code has confirmed the presence of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ed549c2508d6f02c" source="e_80dc2d137eea46f1" target="e_571bc10d653316b8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">allows unauthorized attacker to bypass security feature over</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2e9173412a84326b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Weak authentication in Microsoft Office SharePoint allows an unauthorized attacker to bypass a security feature over a network</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_602833b18f5fb540" source="e_93c1cf93b81bf10a" target="e_1d8a56a09f20a635"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provides exploitability assessment for vulnerability at time of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8671fe122f33c712</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The following table provides an exploitability assessment for this vulnerability at the time of original publication</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_991b8bd225b948fb" source="e_93c1cf93b81bf10a" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provides exploitability assessment for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a04c8d088ef91441</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The following table provides an exploitability assessment for this vulnerability at the time of original publication</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_81baf45d5c2bc774" source="e_d4beeeac98ade229" target="e_b8a83c6170a51b1a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be bypassed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_83cab5db715e1387</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">What kind of security feature could be bypassed by successfully exploiting this vulnerability?</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_bf0fc1c0c66254b7" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_2aeff3eb69ca7874"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">allows</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_30f3e2d364dbe6a8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The authentication feature could be bypassed as this vulnerability allows impersonation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_70c2f5aeef1d4384" source="e_0b8e493fff854103" target="e_3c93021846050c3d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Do apply to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2289f0783a6d675c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Do the updates for SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016 also apply to the version I am running?</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8610f48527bbecd1" source="e_02c0764cfd53cd82" target="e_268309936208c43e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">applies to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e9ccc23dfb739d96</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The same KB number applies to both SharePoint Server 2016 and SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_347b5a18337dc348" source="e_02c0764cfd53cd82" target="e_d009f3a7dad8a7e8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">applies to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dccfb6d987c540cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The same KB number applies to both SharePoint Server 2016 and SharePoint Enterprise Server 2016</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0b477645bd935fce" source="e_418d8f26c83870f3" target="e_a8467b3b679857f9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">install</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_752fcc6756c32468</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Customers running either version should install the security update to be protected from this vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_900d21bfa4d31e1f" source="e_dc1a92928d8fd579" target="e_3c93021846050c3d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be running</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8e915c7a1c26c32e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Customers running either version should install the security update to be protected from this vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fad55ae3ec9ea4a9" source="e_d10f040039249e07" target="e_dfd2e098a96fa540"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">lead to major loss of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9e24ff259b0c253e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">According to the CVSS metrics, successful exploitation of this vulnerability could lead to major loss of confidentiality (C:H), and integrity (I:H), but could lead to no loss of availability (A:N)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fabb9f0645661229" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_93d8650fe6b85a54"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">impact availability of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e7f68e4ac53b166e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Exploiting this vulnerability could allow an attacker to disclose files and modify data, but the attacker cannot impact the availability of the system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b1ce5aeaa47733ba" source="e_d76f0b71c9538da5" target="e_b08ea7e3d08237a2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">allow attacker to disclose</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_137688b2a2482c7b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Exploiting this vulnerability could allow an attacker to disclose files and modify data, but the attacker cannot impact the availability of the system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fd97db94bd53a1c1" source="e_d76f0b71c9538da5" target="e_ee12d6c9a317c4ae"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">allow attacker</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ff713429c7635970</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Exploiting this vulnerability could allow an attacker to disclose files and modify data, but the attacker cannot impact the availability of the system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f78ccbf02a5a727a" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d0985a9e8998d774</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">How could an attacker exploit this vulnerability?</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_2b29dbaf8ab02703" source="e_e34c73ce7cdf1ddd" target="e_cdb33ae117c89291"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">bypass authentication In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4e7e6574f261b7aa</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In a network-based attack, an unauthenticated attacker could bypass authentication and make an anonymous connection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_254ad57b618d3752" source="e_e34c73ce7cdf1ddd" target="e_98419d6c0bf73fb9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">bypass</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_20fcbde1322fd130</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In a network-based attack, an unauthenticated attacker could bypass authentication and make an anonymous connection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_1904df326379c8d1" source="e_e34c73ce7cdf1ddd" target="e_5e5c40ee6210030c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">make</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b35fff1b02adeef4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C03</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In a network-based attack, an unauthenticated attacker could bypass authentication and make an anonymous connection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_2ac3b6c4da100a1c" source="e_a1dcdd289f57b065" target="e_15c6d0b1e60c9c9a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">protect customers through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8a8023041ecd6c69</data><data key="edge_source_id">S39</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-55040</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S39_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Microsoft recognize