ps://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- August 18, 2026: CISA adds CVE-2026-55040 to its KEV catalog</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_84b5ecd2b7bfefb4" source="e_dc576b7e1d7a71f5" target="e_87eee21844f2b349"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are published by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b69e40dacb1a00a4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- August 24, 2026: Rapid7 publishes technical details for CVE-2026-63520 ahead of schedule after technical details are published by a third-party</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0760f13482633e54" source="e_6f86ae8844c3ae87" target="e_82d77a759d87d5b6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">publishes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3f35e012e097fa26</data><data key="edge_source_id">S41</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-cve-2026-63520-microsoft-sharepoint-remote-code-execution-fixed/</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S41_C04</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">- August 24, 2026: Rapid7 publishes technical details for CVE-2026-63520 ahead of schedule after technical details are published by a third-party</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f2eda29fd7a1595" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_466e6377cc3c1257"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">reflects</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_81dc8a82f1fa6a88</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric reflects the context by which vulnerability exploitation is possible</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fc4e041ab7a78fc3" source="e_bf255aff8978049b" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be in to exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b8e52422e0da0c40</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Base Score increases the more remote (logically, and physically) an attacker can be in order to exploit the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_04d4037b96ac12d8" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_6222cbe778251f55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_27440b6cceab1bc6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_bf30e443f58a218b" source="e_f18bdb19e94ba6dc" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exist in to exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c0cfabf3112c85ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the conditions beyond the attacker’s control that must exist in order to exploit the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d8287f52b315cb94" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_01558e47b2eef8dd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1bc626293890e6b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fa7230aae4712a49" source="e_67850df17ab6ea20" target="e_7c2ea70eaaaaf7b7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2050416aa0f1571c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Such conditions may require the collection of more information about the target or computational exceptions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_779663530fce7827" source="e_213a633d7417fc58" target="e_70d08b8077a5c72d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is required</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_64c0df6c3ca8b04f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">If a specific configuration is required for an attack to succeed, the Base metrics should be scored assuming the vulnerable component is in that configuration</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c25699f145843571" source="e_2676df0405400172" target="e_6222cbe778251f55"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">depends on conditions beyond</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_491c947a5631e388</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A successful attack depends on conditions beyond the attacker's control</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_03e66600fd8c1536" source="e_98cce595c63a7b41" target="e_d83c6060f62112fc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">requires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1c5fcf0b7602c7cb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, a successful attack cannot be accomplished at will, but requires the attacker to invest in some measurable amount of effort in preparation or execution against the vulnerable component before a successful attack can be expected</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4e74ab6e106585cb" source="e_2676df0405400172" target="e_5ad6c123e5abaf11"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require attacker to For</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6123155d9b705b6f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f4073b7148a50f94" source="e_2676df0405400172" target="e_8bcb72d0586280a2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_167e519a1bfed280</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_95a9d9a39affabd1" source="e_8ed91b82735ab1f6" target="e_106a49c8576bc28c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exists</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cc67e0ef15182cb2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_7af7c4c284414ab7" source="e_2c33221afeaddb2d" target="e_a762bf544297a778"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be requested by victim in to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bc470a5f771b70b4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4eeb25ff4139eec9" source="e_2c33221afeaddb2d" target="e_8aee7839894cb30b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be requested by victim</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3c802d860467e687</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_c2f6294cec7fa20f" source="e_2c33221afeaddb2d" target="e_997847e8cee53e6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be requested by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b13d153ec1e5ca4a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, a successful attack may require an attacker to: gather knowledge about the environment in which the vulnerable target/component exists; prepare the target environment to improve exploit reliability; or inject themselves into the logical network path between the target and the resource requested by the victim in order to read and/or modify network communications (e.g., a man in the middle attack)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b034bd4485de03d7" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">describes level of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9ab1189dbb254912</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f9fd074e0d06b87a" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess before exploiting vulnerability</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8cbc759d5b90b3e1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b1bf3986f33a7525" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_1b50c049dec6c218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">possess</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_37ea53743fde3319</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric describes the level of privileges an attacker must possess before successfully exploiting the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8cbe2cfb500d3748" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_9bf6ead54114b2ce"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unauthorized prior to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_af2dfcb5b4f46eba</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The attacker is unauthorized prior to attack, and therefore does not require any access to settings or files to carry out an attack</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0162974ad5b8670d" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_4ff55a19c43dfad3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">captures</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_33de7afabaec90b2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ea68052505e3f98e" source="e_1c8a4e08eb9cf221" target="e_0651ca14b1e582f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be participate in successful compromise</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_afaad53e8628edb1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric captures the requirement for a user, other than the attacker, to participate in the successful compromise the vulnerable component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5e87d4cbd0bb4fa3" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited at will of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3c91fa5f764a2511</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_ac2d7e5701c27a98" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_060bbd297383d5a7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be exploited</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6dfdc0caa1f53bbc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric determines whether the vulnerability can be exploited solely at the will of the attacker, or whether a separate user (or user-initiated process) must participate in some manner</data><data key="