ality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b9582b97d47fb6b6" source="e_87a35caaa98faf5a" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affect resources managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_627f2909d8e0d5b9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_567326f33b86d70d" source="e_c4631f903e1159e5" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_307e2aeb6a82c597</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An exploited vulnerability can only affect resources managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_79ce836f12dab867" source="e_0651ca14b1e582f2" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_227c735abcc21401</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9294c0ba3608ce3c" source="e_26e0466f06957bd3" target="e_41977bbb956fd210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are same In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_031877e223d88a0e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c26693bb08f4c7a7" source="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd" target="e_c7bbd6f495adf548"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_21d9f3dc99ba5300</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In this case, the vulnerable component and the impacted component are either the same, or both are managed by the same security authority</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_91de3fa222a18ab6" source="e_841d5cae83210039" target="e_c1b8569aebaf6353"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9a55f2c389d9b530</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the confidentiality of the information resources managed by a software component due to a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_dddc7a50cbb28ff6" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_6e5ec707cbc044ff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d2e93a4809edcea1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e4a5f9a6124e5704" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_8b2074bad160dde7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_37ba400846117837</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6e291aa5f9714ab2" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_a15d5fd58349b1ad"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to preventing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_03521c275562e4af</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_482a9efaa853dd4e" source="e_fabb36a448bb30b7" target="e_eb1797b298a230c0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disclosed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_63a6ddc7c5e8378e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, access to only some restricted information is obtained, but the disclosed information presents a direct, serious impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_90173be5b24d9469" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to trustworthiness of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_016378329187bc94</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f01ac2bf297b4b27" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_edea54677a8d7d64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8ec44dd26a344ba6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2c4f5ef99a939b4b" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_26e0466f06957bd3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3b7778b514b35f85</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_886a2419dca2c79e" source="e_332fd4a216e1c401" target="e_2228b2b192c550b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f27b57738829c8c0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the availability of the impacted component resulting from a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b67f410d5418ae77" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_b6ca085d15d6ffbc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1bcf2f524e86e27e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">It refers to the loss of availability of the impacted component itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_54355548032a6ab7" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_841d5cae83210039"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8014cb934806c245</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a0af84d4cfbcc45d" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_bf0bee0969a73481"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9b3492437e2abd14</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_58444858b5d1be47" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_d37e8eb9896152d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_accc42413d71a059</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_26eba3f10dd2c1dc" source="e_22e800482ee5b5fd" target="e_4058f076b2d4719d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consume</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fc06f90b4213640a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of an impacted component</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f66d02736e897fdb" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_b082256680928c6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">causes service to become</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a9979708e0532f8a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_a406d2e1227d95dc" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_9111a79bb0a0398b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">causes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8f6616a3a2bbf74e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S42</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-63520</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S42_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, the attacker has the ability to deny some availability, but the loss of availability presents a direct, serious consequence to the impacted component (e.g., the attacker cannot disrupt existing connections, but can prevent new connections; the attacker can repeatedly exploit a vulnerability that, in each instance of a successful attack, leaks a only small amount of memory, but after repeated exploitation causes a service to become completely unavailable)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_0ed99eff7d6423d4" source="e_db6268d6f310949e" target="e_b082256680928c6b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw