ta key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected component forms part of the Windows IPsec and IKEv2 stack, which is widely used to provide secure network connectivity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_11e1e7d012415c72" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_7ee4f31b32cb5668"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_938c23bda9efa587</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_076394d3363a37b7" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_f09a5209695fafaa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4af6f427e8921a1d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2003708b3d17ddde" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_68162ebde78d919c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9749ba9ea398e79d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1599e9719956fa2a" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_7ee4f31b32cb5668"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed at network perimeter to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d35167f4affd24bd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f7a7f5761cae2e22" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_f09a5209695fafaa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed at network perimeter to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c29c438ce42408c5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_57001cae88225165" source="e_a05dbb2f9eacc462" target="e_68162ebde78d919c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is deployed at network perimeter to support</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a0e87999ebe2e8e2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Internet Key Exchange is commonly deployed at the network perimeter to support site-to-site VPNs, remote access VPNs, and Windows Always On VPN</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_170d3c222cfc8047" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_99f76ce9f5fe44e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to untrusted networks As</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b4161fd62addaea2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a38195561ffadcf4" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_99f76ce9f5fe44e5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to processes unauthenticated traffic As</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1bed447bab0bdaea</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a8de3486abfba4e2" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_3d33bcab7851ab3b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_94aedfe34fce604e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8a121308d39bb3be" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_93a987c6ae52ebdd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_422147349b401c68</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_df32d62f136726d6" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_58b0291cfd3371ee"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to untrusted networks as part of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_933af1f907e2fd99</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1df3b19fc059198d" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_58b0291cfd3371ee"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is exposed to processes unauthenticated traffic as part of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2edd1ccd8f375fed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">As a result, it is frequently exposed to untrusted networks and processes unauthenticated traffic as part of normal operation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_094f9b3ed5304615" source="e_2e8d7f4ac55321e1" target="e_cc5cee2d4857ec74"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">have disproportionate security impact particularly in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ff589a7476888250</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Vulnerabilities in this service can therefore have a disproportionate security impact, particularly in environments where VPN infrastructure is directly accessible from the internet</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_11126eb9c44f005d" source="e_b2e50e5b713fa27d" target="e_9a9a051cdee05721"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is accessible from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_19bbd0a4bb2ba5c4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Vulnerabilities in this service can therefore have a disproportionate security impact, particularly in environments where VPN infrastructure is directly accessible from the internet</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_37a4d3e03cdd74d5" source="e_e89a40e488525a7c" target="e_91b1acc2a9695219"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is caused by memory management error within</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_85aea1524a22d2e5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">CVE-2026-33824 is caused by a memory management error within the Windows IKE Service Extensions</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c19743eaf8bedf4e" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_f6693345b0c05574"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">arises from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cb254eb8276666f8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Specifically, the vulnerability arises from a double free condition, where the same region of memory is released more than once during the processing of specially crafted IKE packets</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6f646ac5c9f03aef" source="e_b89cef742f5e5473" target="e_f6693345b0c05574"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is released more than once</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_71c167dcbcb80367</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Specifically, the vulnerability arises from a double free condition, where the same region of memory is released more than once during the processing of specially crafted IKE packets</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1dd5d64cb149305c" source="e_b89cef742f5e5473" target="e_f6693345b0c05574"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is released during processing of crafted IKE packets</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4bf481c4a98462a6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Specifically, the vulnerability arises from a double free condition, where the same region of memory is released more than once during the processing of specially crafted IKE packets</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c218f20c007f7002" source="e_b89cef742f5e5473" target="e_f6693345b0c05574"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is released</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_80b4113d422fb912</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Specifically, the vulnerability arises from a double free condition, where the same region of memory is released more than once during the processing of specially crafted IKE packets</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_da56fe8cd9cbce3e" source="e_d7e463de17faf1c1" target="e_40277cc0f3735575"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be allowing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_03fab61f0ae39c9d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This class of vulnerability can lead to heap corruption, potentially allowing an attacker to influence memory allocation behaviour and ultimately control execution flow</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4f4f05ad40fc4946" source="e_d7e463de17faf1c1" target="e_d77f522e6a8e6b56"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be allowing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fe31d1bd0a3ad615</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This class of vulnerability can lead to heap corruption, potentially allowing an attacker to influence memory allocation behaviour and ultimately control execution flow</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_a129dc1ae752550f" source="e_d7e463de17faf1c1" target="e_c2923e925aa6f233"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be allowing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4bc37a1a5197b094</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This class of vulnerability can lead to heap corruption, potentially allowing an attacker to influence memory allocation behaviour and ultimately control execution flow</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data