ecially crafted IKE traffic to a vulnerable system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_27773fa96e863244" source="e_bb46d8ce39883e67" target="e_9d9c39e91777bd72"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is reachable via</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_69329b3b5d75531a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected code path is reachable via UDP ports 500 and 4500, which are the standard ports used by IKE and IKE NAT traversal</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7708f9499c760617" source="e_2814255e6d9edcc5" target="e_9ffb7cbec78fa95f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8b1e6d3c32ab6da7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected code path is reachable via UDP ports 500 and 4500, which are the standard ports used by IKE and IKE NAT traversal</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4f1402faf36d90d6" source="e_2814255e6d9edcc5" target="e_b77ad8d489ccdc25"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3848bcae31de3595</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected code path is reachable via UDP ports 500 and 4500, which are the standard ports used by IKE and IKE NAT traversal</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_08986de31d1162f6" source="e_9d9c39e91777bd72" target="e_9ffb7cbec78fa95f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are standard ports used by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ca0964e74011a7c5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected code path is reachable via UDP ports 500 and 4500, which are the standard ports used by IKE and IKE NAT traversal</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_58255ccdeda63b04" source="e_9d9c39e91777bd72" target="e_b77ad8d489ccdc25"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are standard ports used by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_aeb316cdb86dc1de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The affected code path is reachable via UDP ports 500 and 4500, which are the standard ports used by IKE and IKE NAT traversal</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_28923f2771c3c6ee" source="e_81e51c3eea2575e0" target="e_66f2901c32e1210d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">exploit</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_364a494bb7a3702b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">At the time of writing, Microsoft has not released proof-of-concept exploit code and there is no confirmed evidence of active exploitation in the wild</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d464fee803c25133" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_c3b059ee268b1ded"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affects wide range of supported Windows platforms including Windows Server 2016 through to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_47c886c29e319b15</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability affects a wide range of supported Windows platforms, including Windows Server 2016 through to Windows Server 2025, as well as multiple versions of Windows 10 and Windows 11 across different system architectures</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_67000785a4ff7ab2" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_5f5c688adc26f126"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affects wide range of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_53f1f3512a99b053</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The vulnerability affects a wide range of supported Windows platforms, including Windows Server 2016 through to Windows Server 2025, as well as multiple versions of Windows 10 and Windows 11 across different system architectures</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f50e20c382515c00" source="e_556b627b7c43e3ef" target="e_ce88384c05221555"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">have applied</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_65da07f8e7034da7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Systems that have not applied the April 2026 security updates should be considered vulnerable</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_52f83d4aeb556860" source="e_556b627b7c43e3ef" target="e_dc2cefbd5c093801"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4ead5716bc9da5e7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Systems that have not applied the April 2026 security updates should be considered vulnerable</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_90c3aacc6892d654" source="e_c26ed3c3ca390d6e" target="e_08b98c0435c3fe62"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are available in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_291572394f96f2fa</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Full details of affected versions and corresponding updates are available in the Microsoft Security Update Guide</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1b6ac47babfb5560" source="e_ec57db67a9f0be72" target="e_08b98c0435c3fe62"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are available in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c0d932fa2b236605</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Full details of affected versions and corresponding updates are available in the Microsoft Security Update Guide</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fb1450d401cfb626" source="e_16ea76003b3fd67e" target="e_26aa4de4630a84d2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">result in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b5bcae8fdd579976</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Successful exploitation would result in remote code execution within the context of the IKE service</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ca894b0b34e19950" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_5c5d3d12f56bd772"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">gain complete control of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bf5c848d32ebdde6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker could gain complete control of the affected system, deploy additional tooling, and potentially move laterally into other parts of the environment</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3b4fa4ee149710b3" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_52644125077cfe4e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">move</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7482e21784054048</data><data key="edge_source_id">S46</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.sentrium.co.uk/labs/windows-ike-service-extensions-vulnerability-enables-remote-code-execution-cve-2026-33824</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">None</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">An attacker could gain complete control of the affected system, deploy additional tooling, and potentially move laterally into other parts of the environment</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_cae99d5ccc149e4e" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_106a49c8576bc28c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">move into other parts of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ccf9862f