 open framework for communicating characteristics of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b63b1aa748ed4e2b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) is an open framework for communicating the characteristics and severity of software vulnerabilities</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fed0f9430909ed04" source="e_b585119b28a1d6c9" target="e_e6145aa9c0971bc2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is open framework for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b0d309cf60e7d119</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) is an open framework for communicating the characteristics and severity of software vulnerabilities</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ed9fa317a62aa679" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_ca335c133f4134dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are constant over</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_40d3b0c93efc73ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Base group represents the intrinsic qualities of a vulnerability that are constant over time and across user environments, the Threat group reflects the characteristics of a vulnerability that change over time, and t