n-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Base metric values are combined with default values that assume the highest severity for Threat and Environmental metrics to produce a score ranging from 0 to 10</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0a8209964dad43d7" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_ffae0dc6a3d899f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on applicable threat intelligence To</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_568f1fae3d250d36</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_9590f95287faf57c" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_ffae0dc6a3d899f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on environmental considerations To</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_032401d20d98f10f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_25314ffa43