re, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_8be3da2afe4047ea" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_77377c63215af1ac"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_20c3f2980a9ac1ff</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d57833139075d251" source="e_b54a46ece8e786db" target="e_5a369f24b93fe08b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ba9361d3a7a72a2a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d7e12eccc583ca02" source="e_b54a46ece8e786db" target="e_77377c63215af1ac"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_36822394e410f8de</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data 