ata><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Both the database and the smart speaker it serves would be considered the vulnerable system if a vulnerability in that database leads to the malfunction of the smart speaker</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1ba3433048fb842b" source="e_f7ee09f252645dc4" target="e_008c5289d9ee1bc8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">leads to malfunction of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2ffeb6a102b1e786</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Both the database and the smart speaker it serves would be considered the vulnerable system if a vulnerability in that database leads to the malfunction of the smart speaker</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_788e14a23ddcbd7a" source="e_57e6975d8ca79e1f" target="e_7ee1ff4a70457dd7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_29d612610a6bc53f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Both the database and the smart speaker it serves would be considered the vulnerable system if a vulnerability in that database leads to the malfunction of the smart speaker</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3ceb351d2ecc5953" source="e_008c5289d9ee1bc8" target="e_7ee1ff4a70457dd7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5bd74d0360e2f53b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Both the database and the smart speaker it serves would be considered the vulnerable system if a vulnerability in that database leads to the malfunction of the smart speaker</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d2bc1fd8b8c63e8d" source="e_96b21e596f0b3131" target="e_7d71f6b7f3df9b75"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be defined for System of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9f3b8ea0d6656d12</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When assessed in the environmental metric group only, the subsequent system impact may, in addition to the logical systems defined for System of Interest, also include impacts to humans</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_8701d9aa61fb02ce" source="e_664d5b9e60c68b47" target="e_4da291eb02ed18ba"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include impacts to humans When assessed in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bfa29348dbe5dbd1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When assessed in the environmental metric group only, the subsequent system impact may, in addition to the logical systems defined for System of Interest, also include impacts to humans</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3976a439a97e59d2" source="e_664d5b9e60c68b47" target="e_645d0ce51432ea33"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include impacts to humans in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_467a1b78c4b14ac3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When assessed in the environmental metric group only, the subsequent system impact may, in addition to the logical systems defined for System of Interest, also include impacts to humans</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_a896683726429aaf" source="e_664d5b9e60c68b47" target="e_8a7307f97709a377"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_52741b0a6a612fd6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When assessed in the environmental metric group only, the subsequent system impact may, in addition to the logical systems defined for System of Interest, also include impacts to humans</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f527269c0fb49af5" source="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c" target="e_88e64807c1335218"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be managed by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c75fca74beb1cc40</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the confidentiality of the information managed by the system due to a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8268a877c16206ac" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_6e5ec707cbc044ff"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f56129517da8c736</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_49f0d66429fe3d54" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_8b2074bad160dde7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to limiting</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6665c95dcae6e86f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_95bd14bd22cb4449" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_a15d5fd58349b1ad"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to preventing</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ac5011871df88250</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Confidentiality refers to limiting information access and disclosure to only authorized users, as well as preventing access by, or disclosure to, unauthorized ones</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_747b4d164519db25" source="e_fabb36a448bb30b7" target="e_eb1797b298a230c0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">disclosed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_383901152199d84a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Alternatively, access to only some restricted information is obtained, but the disclosed information presents a direct, serious impact</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5d1cc2246e39ee3d" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_2079f7f0585a6a0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to trustworthiness of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fbe94620b0595f2e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d2bf9ade268714f1" source="e_53dd9263602ab61d" target="e_edea54677a8d7d64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_65ac0887fe184c7f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity refers to the trustworthiness and veracity of information</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_19881385fe7eca5c" source="e_537e6ab50e8f2e44" target="e_7480891027286356"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">causes unauthorized modification of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1f426fbf02be0445</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity of a system is impacted when an attacker causes unauthorized modification of system data</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_998ed726d7d9c66d" source="e_3c74f9bc0c3d9897" target="e_0d98bdebc161a913"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">repudiate</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_098bb569d55dccc1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity is also impacted when a system user can repudiate critical actions taken in the context of the system (e.g. due to insufficient logging)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f7b061c8035eaf65" source="e_b94205d7b8488886" target="e_93d8650fe6b85a54"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be taken in context of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_00c4cd4b6d0d88bf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Integrity is also impacted when a system user can repudiate critical actions taken in the context of the system (e.g. due to insufficient logging)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_240fe4e013d9bff7" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_7ee1ff4a70457dd7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9e6483e3bbfa4a7b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the Vulnerable System</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_00b552d761ea89c4" source="e_d2b630e61129d09b" target="e_546996a8b2a435a8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be protected by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ae1321a5b54e25f9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the attacker is able to modify any/all files protected by the Subsequent System</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5bfa572fd26a280d" source="e_301c0352802feb18" target="e_2228b2b192c550b5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be resulting from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_86f18c26050e2657</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric measures the impact to the availability of the impacted system resulting from a successfully exploited vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1217c0c0bdf69876" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_71703e10d47b8ce5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">apply to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a8a3713426b64049</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d5ceef0c1e981c63" source="e_dfd2e098a96fa540" target="e_53dd9263602ab61d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">apply to loss of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7ae5701cfe4359e5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f38b7cd98d606283" source="e_09f091e141fb1fa3" target="e_71703e10d47b8ce5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">apply to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_23aaa6fab1a42261</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0eca08e294f017be" source="e_09f091e141fb1fa3" target="e_53dd9263602ab61d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">apply to loss of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4854335c4eef9ab0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d84977c8c85fb009" source="e_61641163de7ce9bc" target="e_93d8650fe6b85a54"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d28a1e99a40baf21</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_626e90c6ce9b5c1e" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_e39e00d65a54b413"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to loss of availability of impacted system itself such as networked service While</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6cd5efa585553bda</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3283b229db8005f6" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_dc9161ca0cec7b3b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f4d3a9b400860fa1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While the Confidentiality and Integrity impact metrics apply to the loss of confidentiality or integrity of data (e.g., information, files) used by the system, this metric refers to the loss of availability of the impacted system itself, such as a networked service (e.g., web, database, email)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_54f630851dd431a8" source="e_22e800482ee5b5fd" target="e_4058f076b2d4719d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consume</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6762b1961be986eb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of a system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_97e01deb95ac3e15" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_841d5cae83210039"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0f12bf56f42571cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of a system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a52d05c57f3ec0c6" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_bf0bee0969a73481"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_71755478ee4e5a47</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of a system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_33ec3fdef084d092" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_d37e8eb9896152d1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">refers to accessibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_49dcecc1e899103a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Since availability refers to the accessibility of information resources, attacks that consume network bandwidth, processor cycles, or disk space all impact the availability of a system</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_779f4bb17e2c8805" source="e_d8d9b706557f592e" target="e_fbbdf1417a7b6e3e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be deny</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0638a018dacc1c2c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Even if repeated exploitation of the vulnerability is possible, the attacker does not have the ability to completely deny service to legitimate users</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_c40256467be5fbd2" source="e_d8d9b706557f592e" target="e_9111a79bb0a0398b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be deny</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f6750b4259eda130</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Even if repeated exploitation of the vulnerability is possible, the attacker does not have the ability to completely deny service to legitimate users</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_e8c04aea7b4e92d0" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_ee6b44aab89ae669"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">measure</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f384c2922e810c55</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C14</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Threat metrics measure the current state of exploit techniques or code availability for a vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1cf0e44a9185f1f2" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_1d52