_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3322641c2c693a2f" source="e_7c44b98bb5fdf85f" target="e_921422646cf15ec9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">increases number of potential attackers by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_559ba794f81cd8cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C14</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Public availability of easy-to-use exploit code or exploitation instructions increases the number of potential attackers by including those who are unskilled</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5a8b719c6939a0a2" source="e_be1010a91c010968" target="e_b4e364ab91d013d5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">increases number of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_00f362ea7e6c8f29</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C14</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Public availability of easy-to-use exploit code or exploitation instructions increases the number of potential attackers by including those who are unskilled</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_bb052cef21cb2f63" source="e_7c44b98bb5fdf85f" target="e_b4e364ab91d013d5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">increases number of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_25f30aa0d2b8e2c1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S50</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S50_C14</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</