</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Base metric values are combined with default values that assume the highest severity for Threat and Environmental metrics to produce a score ranging from 0 to 10</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3060d09f9f7903c8" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_ffae0dc6a3d899f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on applicable threat intelligence To</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6d5e1f99d8477fd2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_cf2c3ebafe0c6736" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_ffae0dc6a3d899f2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on environmental considerations To</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c14fdedd972c90e5</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">po