ity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_84b3884f90e8425e" source="e_b02545dbef6b631f" target="e_77377c63215af1ac"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6821ce3d70f66917</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_09949d27e0f3d72b" source="e_b54a46ece8e786db" target="e_5a369f24b93fe08b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_9e70e4cddb77f424</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4f3318b601929421" source="e_b54a46ece8e786db" target="e_77377c63215af1ac"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be amended based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2e8fd02178f336e2</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">To further refine a resulting severity score, Threat and Environmental metrics can then be amended based on applicable threat intelligence and environmental considerations</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b9ea6c2da28f1ed1" source="e_2b3df5e798af4a3c" target="e_6fb05c788d94028e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">do modify</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dcd80c27bcafde45</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Supplemental metrics do not modify the final score, and are used as additional insight into the characteristics of a vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6ca3735c93f99791" source="e_2b3df5e798af4a3c" target="e_be51db49eb59d924"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are used as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_11d672f80ce2699c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Supplemental metrics do not modify the final score, and are used as additional insight into the characteristics of a vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6442be957d8a5f7e" source="e_fccda449563e87c8" target="e_707af8c91bb1d910"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">consists of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_20419989fdc882a9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A CVSS vector string consists of a compressed textual representation of the values used to derive the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9bd4c21103f00c4b" source="e_a9ed604eb1323e31" target="e_4364e67a28b13c95"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used to derive</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_335c07558374e6e6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A CVSS vector string consists of a compressed textual representation of the values used to derive the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_3a8dac817188dbfb" source="e_b1abc47325cb826c" target="e_e94f91e35c1b7dcb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be found at</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0177a11f67de3fa3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The most current CVSS resources can be found at https://www.first.org/cvss/</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3f466ef9c3f1ea1b" source="e_29f374d3ae492bbc" target="e_81cbd545ac116bb7"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">reserves</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c4a8ca37391519aa</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">FIRST reserves the right to update CVSS and this document periodically at its sole discretion</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_984ac31555d75697" source="e_599b6cd1166e8fab" target="e_3cf72a85fc7edc64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be update</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_abce6ce681f2c1a1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">FIRST reserves the right to update CVSS and this document periodically at its sole discretion</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b369be260b8f57c6" source="e_29f374d3ae492bbc" target="e_7d71f6b7f3df9b75"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">owns</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_003aaec944a0192f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">While FIRST owns all rights and interest in CVSS, it licenses it to the public freely for use, subject to the conditions below</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4de46dea2bf0934e" source="e_022732e26b7b8bc6" target="e_3cf72a85fc7edc64"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is required to use</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d4bad5c710aa006b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Membership in FIRST is not required to use or implement CVSS</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_66efb38f8e638c78" source="e_022732e26b7b8bc6" target="e_a0d60350cd3ed040"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is required</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_32b631d71077370a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Membership in FIRST is not required to use or implement CVSS</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8f6ed4233cf2ce7c" source="e_749697968074f926" target="e_803d80074cf06ab9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">used</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_af5d553be437a3a0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">FIRST does, however, require that any individual or entity using CVSS give proper attribution, where applicable, that CVSS is owned by FIRST and used by permission</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8405a177ece49ee9" source="e_29f374d3ae492bbc" target="e_27c4675b5b5e8da0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">requires</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0e4ceaaff573eec0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Further, FIRST requires as a condition of use that any individual or entity which publishes CVSS data conforms to the guidelines described in this document and provides both the score and the scoring vector so others can understand how the score was derived</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f6245f72706e46e0" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_f8b520c0a0b6460f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used to calculate</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_da8ea0ee09aa2473</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Numerical CVSS Scores have very different meanings based on the metrics used to calculate them</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5279de02d8fba2c3" source="e_105cc5cf493c670f" target="e_904da0b4f3960fb3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be Regarding</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cf9793bf64be454b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Regarding prioritization, the usefulness of a numerical CVSS score is directly proportional to the CVSS metrics leveraged to generate that score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2c2d7d73d1c25fcd" source="e_af47c659804da2a9" target="e_c92a80f863b1c7d6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is proportional</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c6353210d20c11f4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Regarding prioritization, the usefulness of a numerical CVSS score is directly proportional to the CVSS metrics leveraged to generate that score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c622737b0a780c01" source="e_af47c659804da2a9" target="e_86cd872f75c203db"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is proportional to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fe64f3ee4c12646c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Regarding prioritization, the usefulness of a numerical CVSS score is directly proportional to the CVSS metrics leveraged to generate that score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_439a0019bb124f11" source="e_f6a7ad56b5ba29ba" target="e_4364e67a28b13c95"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be leveraged to generate that</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b34ac2aeee03ccf3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Regarding prioritization, the usefulness of a numerical CVSS score is directly proportional to the CVSS metrics leveraged to generate that score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1e29d9d592faec02" source="e_b189ba3fb7ef7706" target="e_1af6c78accf2e433"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be enumerated</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7d96850b10afbd63</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Therefore, numerical CVSS scores should be enumerated using nomenclature that communicates the metrics used in its generation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5d1fd31224dd5cbc" source="e_7d27fcc704b7bc10" target="e_bbcb8ea999353380"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">communicates metrics used in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_33960efa9e49bca0</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Therefore, numerical CVSS scores should be enumerated using nomenclature that communicates the metrics used in its generation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7569d7010f731631" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_bbcb8ea999353380"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4b5cdd2a45bccbdc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C01</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Therefore, numerical CVSS scores should be enumerated using nomenclature that communicates the metrics used in its generation</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f7aee0aeb992b9f8" source="e_7d27fcc704b7bc10" target="e_2ba6413f73942dca"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be used</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_96d464b362efc91c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This nomenclature should be used wherever a numerical CVSS value is displayed or communicated</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_dc99f60e8e7960d2" source="e_9e3f8e0349f649b1" target="e_d800caf744b5709e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is responsibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_93be65285afe6051</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The application of Environmental and Threat metrics is the responsibility of the CVSS consumer</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_40d367bfe0bf8647" source="e_845db19a5f318ea7" target="e_d800caf744b5709e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is responsibility of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_904b5b6c5c12f2d1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The application of Environmental and Threat metrics is the responsibility of the CVSS consumer</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5b974db679493a55" source="e_7563cb4baa21b7ab" target="e_51321b750147cbd0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provide Base Scores enumerated as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_40e349f35b2b032b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Assessment providers such as product maintainers and other public/private entities such as the National Vulnerability Database (NVD) typically provide only the Base Scores enumerated as CVSS-B</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_249a29ffe291556f" source="e_817fb241c4f3fb8a" target="e_51321b750147cbd0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provide Base Scores enumerated as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0449daa8a999acfb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Assessment providers such as product maintainers and other public/private entities such as the National Vulnerability Database (NVD) typically provide only the Base Scores enumerated as CVSS-B</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6db846cbbb2cd2d7" source="e_0aeb5fdf6effbdc8" target="e_51321b750147cbd0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be enumerated as</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0ad4c0032e4effbd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Assessment providers such as product maintainers and other public/private entities such as the National Vulnerability Database (NVD) typically provide only the Base Scores enumerated as CVSS-B</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_711d476d16d95e15" source="e_3bca66551d1e30df" target="e_6fb05c788d94028e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are considered in calculation of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8500eae25f110468</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In CVSS v4.0, Base, Threat, and Environmental metric values are always considered in the calculation of the final score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b93c64562557e894" source="e_838a95b0b63fa880" target="e_6fb05c788d94028e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are considered in calculation of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6e8eaa56e7fb8e7f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In CVSS v4.0, Base, Threat, and Environmental metric values are always considered in the calculation of the final score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0165c8cc286e8a03" source="e_84c5fb779fc835d7" target="e_6fb05c788d94028e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are considered in calculation of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e754a32ffc529dd8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In CVSS v4.0, Base, Threat, and Environmental metric values are always considered in the calculation of the final score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_30caebb7bf97ef5f" source="e_ba6a59ae6b0db851" target="e_5e3014756335417a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">result in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7be1f0fbc2f8f739</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The absence of explicit Threat and/or Environmental metric selections will still result in a complete score using default (“Not Defined”) values</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d060d74da4941f4b" source="e_0b1f826002e28a94" target="e_5e3014756335417a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">result in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_d0e199b08c0ea063</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The absence of explicit Threat and/or Environmental metric selections will still result in a complete score using default (“Not Defined”) values</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c4ccf1a468e29fb4" source="e_1738e7185e9abbb3" target="e_44ac22faaa9a633f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be using</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1ce53184aa1a315b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The absence of explicit Threat and/or Environmental metric selections will still result in a complete score using default (“Not Defined”) values</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_11ff3c040633b469" source="e_228b54a1a94571c6" target="e_8fc1e9fb6e48faf5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been updated</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c8a3cd5895e80681</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Specification Document has been updated to emphasize and clarify the fact that CVSS Base (CVSS-B) scores are designed to measure the severity of a vulnerability and should not be used alone to assess risk</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_bc6ff05703ef4c35" source="e_2b936a70397531bf" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are designed to measure severity of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fdda8542d1a4b16e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Specification Document has been updated to emphasize and clarify the fact that CVSS Base (CVSS-B) scores are designed to measure the severity of a vulnerability and should not be used alone to assess risk</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_5abef522d4b1a5e2" source="e_2b936a70397531bf" target="e_87e962f4cdbc59fa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are designed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6b0a57059b2841f8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Specification Document has been updated to emphasize and clarify the fact that CVSS Base (CVSS-B) scores are designed to measure the severity of a vulnerability and should not be used alone to assess risk</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9f91e9bbbf7c0645" source="e_2b936a70397531bf" target="e_51393476429cd733"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are designed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3e7542cba313c0da</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Specification Document has been updated to emphasize and clarify the fact that CVSS Base (CVSS-B) scores are designed to measure the severity of a vulnerability and should not be used alone to assess risk</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_65423931c1c20e96" source="e_2979a68b0d157ffd" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">represents intrinsic characteristics of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_78639fd464af970c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS v4.0 Specification Document clearly states that the CVSS Base Score represents only the intrinsic characteristics of a vulnerability and is independent of any factor associated with threat or the computing environment where the vulnerable system resides</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ed90f6ed7bdb70be" source="e_7ee1ff4a70457dd7" target="e_8b98ab92d36f0036"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">resides</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_383ae85b9587f5fd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS v4.0 Specification Document clearly states that the CVSS Base Score represents only the intrinsic characteristics of a vulnerability and is independent of any factor associated with threat or the computing environment where the vulnerable system resides</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4da6a906d3d45577" source="e_2979a68b0d157ffd" target="e_106a49c8576bc28c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be supplemented with analysis of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_61f86d59f01b001b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Base Score should be supplemented with an analysis of the environment (Environmental Metrics), and with attributes that may change over time (Threat Metrics)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_88cfd9773d3c2088" source="e_29c85f9f417d06f8" target="e_ca335c133f4134dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">change over</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_83924bbf10f0ff5c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Base Score should be supplemented with an analysis of the environment (Environmental Metrics), and with attributes that may change over time (Threat Metrics)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_4fe6101f664c285d" source="e_5a896e5dd7fb3b56" target="e_b14fc5adc67ef919"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4a99451e7974f7a6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_b59aab8ed8d27a35" source="e_5a896e5dd7fb3b56" target="e_0e6888bf4a1aaf69"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ccbfa6091b3646c9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_6c10dab2684ca1d8" source="e_0dd1994901856e68" target="e_b14fc5adc67ef919"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be utilize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e7ec941a00e1684d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_7ba2d538cff3bf09" source="e_0dd1994901856e68" target="e_0e6888bf4a1aaf69"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be utilize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dafbe42b4b9699fc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_e9bbe6ed85bada55" source="e_4f99a70924824209" target="e_6dfa522012c5afb4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">employs automated methods to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ef639ed6abdfdc9b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_0625986d806343b3" source="e_4f99a70924824209" target="e_03f9c000c4111ad9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">employs automated methods to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_844cc6d38bf566b8</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_aeaf9635e056a42e" source="e_4f99a70924824209" target="e_a2e28551293891f1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">employs</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fd59781586049077</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For an organization that employs automated methods to comprehensively utilize the Environmental and Threat metric groups, the resulting CVSS-BTE score can be considered much closer to “Risk”</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_04de927d58ecafd0" source="e_9d2f4ff8b2abcf04" target="e_bcfb0f50315cd8c8"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">produce</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2d260d19e8d6643f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The CVSS Specification Document and User Guide have been updated with additional guidance to help CVSS analysts produce resulting severity scores that are consistent and defensible across various situations that were previously considered ambiguous</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_45dddda84c263cd3" source="e_73c6f4c420f73c37" target="e_43b908d08d2ede0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is listed</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a14e566dc34434f6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A sampling of the new assessment guidance is listed below</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a529e05e059fe37e" source="e_709529ecc03641eb" target="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been replaced with concepts of vulnerable system capturing impacts from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2149e21f12b94363</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The concept of Scope has been replaced with the concepts of a vulnerable system (VC, VI, VA) and a subsequent system (SC, SI, SA), capturing impacts from both, where relevant</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9640805b60060304" source="e_709529ecc03641eb" target="e_ceeb9a417decc9f4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been replaced with concepts of vulnerable system</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_50f60ee5631b788e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The concept of Scope has been replaced with the concepts of a vulnerable system (VC, VI, VA) and a subsequent system (SC, SI, SA), capturing impacts from both, where relevant</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_79fef6115c3bad5a" source="e_709529ecc03641eb" target="e_22d8a27b5ffe2dfd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been replaced with subsequent system capturing impacts from</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e167333b3144704a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The concept of Scope has been replaced with the concepts of a vulnerable system (VC, VI, VA) and a subsequent system (SC, SI, SA), capturing impacts from both, where relevant</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1c1a6285227b4b9c" source="e_709529ecc03641eb" target="e_ceeb9a417decc9f4"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has been replaced with subsequent system</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e40796cd7e01b89b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C02</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidenc