><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_127a78d710c383ee" source="e_ea2100d2276757fa" target="e_c0c52d9068615001"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be impacted by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_38f455206bf50f30</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">A vulnerability that allows other processes to impact the confidentiality, integrity or availability of data or code in a secure enclave has impact to the Vulnerable System (the secure enclave where the exploit occurs) as well as a Subsequent System (a secure enclave impacted by the exploit outside the security boundary of the Vulnerable System)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a6b6fe0c91235c3e" source="e_080b61c8c700b12f" target="e_c00ecbf5fe9852a6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are Subsequent Systems</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5aa503eae56d012a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">When a vulnerability in a web application impacts user clients, e.g., web browsers, the user clients are Subsequent Systems</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_a9ecbaa25e2cd3e0" source="e_017bbd9b23651710" target="e_778160dbe0b1bb41"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_332c63cc3830419b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Common vulnerabilities of this type include cross-site scripting and URL redirection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_95868e897adb3217" source="e_017bbd9b23651710" target="e_807d12a148171d42"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">include</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e8d7f69a24430d64</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Common vulnerabilities of this type include cross-site scripting and URL redirection</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_15bb9d5d9181cb6b" source="e_7c78e1084fcc7cc8" target="e_3bb18dafe4adc735"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be providing connectivity to components in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_47b094c0a4bdffe4</data><data key="edge_source_id">S51</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v4.0/user-guide</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S51_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In a distributed environment, a vulnerability in a component providing connectivity, protection, or authentication services to components in a different security domain should include assessment for the Subsequent System(s) if a successful attack impacts these other components</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_27648269396e9aeb" source="e_7c78e1084fcc7cc8" target="e_3bb18dafe4adc735"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be providing protection to compon