mated attack tools In</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_74ed326ab6266d65</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In severe cases, it may be delivered as the payload of a network-based worm or virus or other automated attack tools</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_560605ca8762100e" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_408292d54548e4e2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be delivered as payload of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ab0404e4a01fd028</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In severe cases, it may be delivered as the payload of a network-based worm or virus or other automated attack tools</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f3bdd839d306f733" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_d77d9809b3e24846"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be delivered as payload of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_41b31e7565b3a30d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In severe cases, it may be delivered as the payload of a network-based worm or virus or other automated attack tools</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f4e927353d19c5d" source="e_ad16450d4d7b98f8" target="e_f8a3f24bbd45b332"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be delivered as payload of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fce2c6635b4b8975</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C10</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">In severe cases, it may be delivered as the payload of a network-based worm or virus or other automated attack tools</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_d6de8a194b9a633a" source="e_527c56c7674a26dd" target="e_904da0b4f3960fb3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is important factor for</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5a57ecd5b66d7efb</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The Remediation Level of a vulnerability is an important factor for prioritization</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_81c35cb09b8434d6" source="e_4228490cbf8a6d91" target="e_98c110f1e21aa4eb"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is unpatched when</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_885d224e84d54727</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The typical vulnerability is unpatched when initially published</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fa0a4e9b71f771cf" source="e_791715a2772f6f50" target="e_ccb9c0114a2220f3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">patch</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_da24fcebd0ce90af</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Workarounds or hotfixes may offer interim remediation until an official patch or upgrade is issued</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_608c710e966cc4fa" source="e_edf56b768b8904e2" target="e_a568574ebde0ab4b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">becomes</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_c079f85f29d35b21</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Each of these respective stages adjusts the Temporal Score downwards, reflecting the decreasing urgency as remediation becomes final</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_48e8eb0c5f75aca4" source="e_66e4de79357567de" target="e_e916c75e8e43cbaf"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">cause</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_643de69e9d47e1ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, an impact may be recognized as undesirable, but the root cause may not be known</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">heuristic</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fdc73647142944bc" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_65410dc16853f229"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7cd6e1014862d8af</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgment by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fe294bc80e4a3300" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_8519ab94a125f3fa"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through acknowledgment by author of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b9e6dd7b594e09ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgment by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_54725651d59c3a1e" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_298a9593b67b7b1f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be confirmed through acknowledgment by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dff744d8377283a1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Finally, a vulnerability may be confirmed through acknowledgment by the author or vendor of the affected technology</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fa3ddda0d4fd72ac" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_cf4606d100a09d0c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is known to exist with</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_98177f87195f329d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The urgency of a vulnerability is higher when a vulnerability is known to exist with certainty</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_647a28dd5997b4cf" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_3655237b10b88be1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">suggests</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_979820626c5b0e3b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This metric also suggests the level of technical knowledge available to would-be attackers</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_44d0b9e1b5b0a6c9" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_99980f1fd9e9f9d2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is validated by vendor</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fabb7e1afdeef127</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The more a vulnerability is validated by the vendor or other reputable sources, the higher the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ae40d38ef67506aa" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_99980f1fd9e9f9d2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is validated by other reputable sources</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_7eb603a0c56723ed</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The more a vulnerability is validated by the vendor or other reputable sources, the higher the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fec1c7aaa0a50580" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_298a9593b67b7b1f"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is validated by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b055061fe02f4583</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The more a vulnerability is validated by the vendor or other reputable sources, the higher the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_841e540d49e90fd0" source="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc" target="e_85440a973052d0c3"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is validated by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bb4102a2673280fe</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C11</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The more a vulnerability is validated by the vendor or other reputable sources, the higher the score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e8f477e8086d9448" source="e_5b4bd0dc3a688939" target="e_e163460c91338b08"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provide</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8324e96ff4252812</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Reasonable confidence exists, however, that the bug is reproducible and at least one impact is able to be verified (proof-of-concept exploits may provide this)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3b72ebddc46dad24" source="e_5fa67428538ac0a0" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">differ on cause of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_166af5686184cadd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The reports indicate that the cause of the vulnerability is unknown, or reports may differ on the cause or impacts of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fc1eb82bd884d34d" source="e_5fa67428538ac0a0" target="e_57598c70746601d2"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">differ on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_70a430c696ff0ebc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The reports indicate that the cause of the vulnerability is unknown, or reports may differ on the cause or impacts of the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_43d78a081d77ce8f" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_5bea4a152db657be"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable analyst to customize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ed663f5d9e2c68a1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of complementary/alternative security controls in place, Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_f47078631aa7126e" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_b5dac192ab4acd82"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable analyst to customize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_aef3e762d9c95456</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of complementary/alternative security controls in place, Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4de1ae26cf0eff26" source="e_919b9b24b29432d4" target="e_a98014409305c0ed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be depending on importance of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_babe973c937d590c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of complementary/alternative security controls in place, Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_60aa04ecbf608ed8" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_80b852b98e6b518c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are modified equivalent of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_380a57dbc42f5c72</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The metrics are the modified equivalent of Base metrics and are assigned values based on the component placement within organizational infrastructure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ffa7f4fab05af495" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_233bab9ef1dafb58"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are assigned</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_3863c7fa533e6141</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The metrics are the modified equivalent of Base metrics and are assigned values based on the component placement within organizational infrastructure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_4d023f39be6d6694" source="e_a9ed604eb1323e31" target="e_c1dc8fe342a2da24"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be based on component placement within</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_669ffbf77ed35593</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The metrics are the modified equivalent of Base metrics and are assigned values based on the component placement within organizational infrastructure</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_813e5843689d4060" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_5bea4a152db657be"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable analyst to customize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b45dcd2e9b409e4c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b0f8e4c6aa91f119" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_b5dac192ab4acd82"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable analyst to customize</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0e48009056e96b95</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d6d9f6f0116a0b11" source="e_919b9b24b29432d4" target="e_a98014409305c0ed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be depending on importance of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cac9445374482349</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to customize the CVSS score depending on the importance of the affected IT asset to a user’s organization, measured in terms of Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9183eecd012acea2" source="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9" target="e_5d1d72902eb15d6e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is most</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4a9466c320fad105</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_64f1c4b95bfd374f" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_4253f9f004cdf845</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_512320102e1ea7c2" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_1a35ca554daf0f47"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_17d952e050a6ee52</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_3911215f568669d8" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_624d33dd68b0de17"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6ff76c435106392f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_e5170b48462e4726" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_8ba0639306d76dcd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_972dbf82f379ba23</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_bef546d11f4d2846" source="e_a93cd344a30befb7" target="e_c52321f3e68882ab"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">supports</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a67cac8fd51bf78c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C12</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, if an IT asset supports a business function for which Availability is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_e3aeddc605a3c522" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_68440427dae094d0"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0c151e360a835062</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_5dee354edea4451b" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_e56e3d4771ca46d9"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_aaac48f22cb04e64</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_fcec0d620b30e53f" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_1a35ca554daf0f47"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_fa78874229fff7cf</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_ad6771f3ad59457d" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_624d33dd68b0de17"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign greater value</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_2814f0763f27fa5b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_f556d6d3f782781e" source="e_f6498126c94c6f96" target="e_8ba0639306d76dcd"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">assign</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b997f92a69e27844</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">is most important, the analyst can assign a greater value to Availability relative to Confidentiality and Integrity</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_1f77dc3e09449b19" source="e_b39009419fada99a" target="e_4d8f9e8bdafd1675"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is determined by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_aa31e336879948a9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The full effect on the environmental score is determined by the corresponding Modified Base Impact metrics</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_78fa61b93cf0d66f" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_6e4023b57818f19c"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">modify environmental score by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f76230fed3b36155</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, these metrics modify the environmental score by reweighting the Modified Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability impact metrics</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_057a4d0195c681e6" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_a73c69185408d210"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">modify environmental score by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_bf2f1c52a22ed1dd</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, these metrics modify the environmental score by reweighting the Modified Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability impact metrics</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_413ad80ee112f1ba" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_ff030cbf387ac699"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">modify environmental score by</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f507c77775769e90</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, these metrics modify the environmental score by reweighting the Modified Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability impact metrics</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ba2977f89a15692f" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_26f020227348bd77"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">modify</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_da03d13eacd09d2f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">That is, these metrics modify the environmental score by reweighting the Modified Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability impact metrics</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_1148969d96d6d23b" source="e_6d3e092553852d96" target="e_5ad6c123e5abaf11"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has increased weight For</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ce4fd4424fd45ae7</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the Modified Confidentiality impact (MC) metric has increased weight if the Confidentiality Requirement (CR) is High</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b2d4201edd085022" source="e_6d3e092553852d96" target="e_458d57708f7bb5f5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has increased</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_298d398a18bca3a6</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">For example, the Modified Confidentiality impact (MC) metric has increased weight if the Confidentiality Requirement (CR) is High</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_d18bd7d8c51ce7b8" source="e_6d3e092553852d96" target="e_458d57708f7bb5f5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">has decreased</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b72d8fa762bdcae3</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Likewise, the Modified Confidentiality impact metric has decreased weight if the Confidentiality Requirement is Low</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_ba4824c09d5bf917" source="e_6e77af671f9ee553" target="e_53dd9263602ab61d"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is applied to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_564375ca6c2cd74e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This same process is applied to the Integrity and Availability requirements</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_b74ab1fcecd8ae42" source="e_6e77af671f9ee553" target="e_3cadf65ee950fb81"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is applied to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_47b2ef025d76cc72</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This same process is applied to the Integrity and Availability requirements</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_72b9167ec3c1a35c" source="e_70ad703709338071" target="e_f90f01579634abed"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is set to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1cd028cd88bd1bbc</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Note that the Confidentiality Requirement will not affect the Environmental score if the (Modified Base) confidentiality impact is set to None</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_e0db175618501a16" source="e_d845c7fc7eb3f84a" target="e_26f020227348bd77"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">affect</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_e2807ebe7dc7934c</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Note that the Confidentiality Requirement will not affect the Environmental score if the (Modified Base) confidentiality impact is set to None</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_c1e1ab97637cb10f" source="e_75ac4e09b3f2b875" target="e_7b4f67c17e442588"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">are set to</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_dd492210e1e39273</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Also, increasing the Confidentiality Requirement from Medium to High will not change the Environmental score when the (Modified Base) impact metrics are set to High</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_99a5fa75932971ff" source="e_c11703dfc0efe312" target="e_26f020227348bd77"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">change</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_b13e86ff21e7a234</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Also, increasing the Confidentiality Requirement from Medium to High will not change the Environmental score when the (Modified Base) impact metrics are set to High</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_9d739fc74aaf0418" source="e_e163460c91338b08" target="e_aeb2050fed2c22c1"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is because</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_88f9b9175a25570f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This is because the Modified Impact Sub-Score (part of the Modified Base Score that calculates impact) is already at a maximum value of 10</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_8c3603fcb0d454be" source="e_aeb2050fed2c22c1" target="e_6ec3afa21d9dd06b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is part of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6250bbac5eae0a17</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This is because the Modified Impact Sub-Score (part of the Modified Base Score that calculates impact) is already at a maximum value of 10</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_2e1ce1e6187d9362" source="e_6ec3afa21d9dd06b" target="e_9ed9f9c2275e8e7e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">calculates</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_180e52b145b8afd1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">This is because the Modified Impact Sub-Score (part of the Modified Base Score that calculates impact) is already at a maximum value of 10</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_eeca2b67759efe61" source="e_030111ecac4d18ed" target="e_074229e4d05d7665"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is considered</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_0c8a2a9f4582655a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">The greater the Security Requirement, the higher the score (recall that Medium is considered the default)</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_6b1ac3b9358f8f05" source="e_a66c07bcfe118fcc" target="e_44fb585ec7e6699b"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be based on specific characteristics of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_1ba47aeff59b4b74</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to override individual Base metrics based on specific characteristics of a user’s environment</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_eb8fccfb20ea36c4" source="e_768bf52735c34131" target="e_7a11f41ec6830267"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">enable analyst to override</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_a9d564c8a7010f3a</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">These metrics enable the analyst to override individual Base metrics based on specific characteristics of a user’s environment</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_073dddfa7cdb0583" source="e_cc7d718fa81c41b8" target="e_337daf79cd2e8352"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be reflected via</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_8cee5aac9106c2f1</data><data key="edge_source_id">S52</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S52_C13</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Characteristics that affect Exploitability, Scope, or Impact can be reflected via an appropriately modified Environmental Score</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">possible</data></edge><edge id="oe_85d25f648881bf6d" source="e_cc7d718fa81c41b8" target="e_8deebfd1151914f5"><data key="ed