measures the degree of difficulty to mitigate the vulnerability in a timely manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_0693ba55f6284b63" source="e_d3b6631e55352c8a" target="e_dbe0386fe7720021"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be mitigate vulnerability in</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_187a03af9d5afb0e</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Mitigation status measures the degree of difficulty to mitigate the vulnerability in a timely manner</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_fe263d08e450d7da" source="e_df0342d74215780d" target="e_e1fe9434401b298a"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">require</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_6bbfce7f85ea3699</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">• Applying the mitigation will require exceptional downtime</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7ccbb60518b076b5" source="e_e74da5591b75881a" target="e_a3534f455e90aea5"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">be reduced • After</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_35400b9b020cd16d</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">• After mitigation, system functionality will be reduced below</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_70ed9e2c9d11d7d7" source="e_f4fd75c9d7b990c9" target="e_34cf20183f45e324"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">Fix</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f7c17894bb772dec</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Type Fix An official patch that remediates the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_30c3b1da60c58308" source="e_34cf20183f45e324" target="e_dbd1ba0cc63988dc"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">remediates</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_ee9c9d644ebde51f</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Type Fix An official patch that remediates the vulnerability</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_917d25f23dff5277" source="e_7b4f67c17e442588" target="e_d5bfbcb5ba84f908"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">is worse than</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5f9fc938b3904dc9</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">high is worse than low</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">positive</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_59ff13ff6a9231bc" source="e_16de2b13fd6fb2c4" target="e_f2a51b0a4629ba4e"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">does change priority of SSVC decision Based on</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_f43be3de9dd83097</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Based on the CISA decision tree, the value of mitigation does not change the priority of the SSVC decision</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_abc8c2e6387dde84" source="e_16de2b13fd6fb2c4" target="e_1f2601d49545e1c6"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">does change priority of</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_5b3887b1dbb5d1df</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key="edge_json_path">None</data><data key="edge_evidence">Based on the CISA decision tree, the value of mitigation does not change the priority of the SSVC decision</data><data key="edge_extraction_method">minie</data><data key="edge_polarity">negative</data><data key="edge_modality">asserted</data></edge><edge id="oe_7649562d41dca76b" source="e_4676679afd99eed0" target="e_6f7684418f21aa11"><data key="edge_predicate_raw">provides likelihood of exploitation For</data><data key="edge_assertion_id">a_cb5ce7a9c349b66b</data><data key="edge_source_id">S54</data><data key="edge_source_url">https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/cisa-ssvc-guide%20508c.pdf</data><data key="edge_chunk_id">S54_C07</data><data key